{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JrRjZ4Ltkkgj8vnMT3U7R9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'C1'' 核心成立但 claims 需降级。Domain ceiling 从 \"predictive framework\"\n2\t  调整为 \"empirical tendency with domain×competence interaction\"：中间复杂度域（C4, Code） 的 K*\n3\t  受 model domain-specific competence 调制，极端域（Wiki, arXiv）稳健。 Code 域叙事从 \"ceiling=2 cross-family\n4\t  confirmed\" 改为 \"ceiling=2 observed in models with adequate code pretraining (Qwen,\n5\t  LLaMA); insufficient code competence yields K*=1 (Pythia, Mistral), consistent with\n6\t  C4 Mistral pattern\"。C3 的 scope 在 Limitations 中更显著呈现，承认 filtering advantage 限于 homogeneous\n7\t  web text + 单一 base model (Qwen-1.5B)，不泛化到 arXiv 或其他 base models。补充实验：可能 需要 arXiv\n8\t  cross-scorer bootstrap CI 的完整呈现、θ-sensitivity full sweep figure。 目标 EMNLP Findings\n9\t  或 borderline Main。审稿人对 Code 域结果的解读分裂： Reviewer A 认为 3/5 models at ceiling 已足够 establish\n10\t  pattern，Reviewer B 认为 2/5 failure 暗示 ceiling 框架 overfits 已有数据。arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer\n11\t  K*=3→2 的下降被一位审稿人视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的证据。θ-sensitivity 被要求做更详细分析（θ=0.55-0.70\n12\t  全谱呈现）。整体 excitement 3.3-3.7， EMNLP Main accept prob 0.25-0.50。\n13\t\n14\t  '\n15\timagined_experiments:\n16\t- name: mvp-001\n17\t  plan_id: mvp_pilot_sat_v1\n18\t  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct rewrite mode pilot, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    k_star: 2\n21\t    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9956\n22\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6957\n23\t    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5893\n24\t    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.5434\n25\t    pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5343\n26\t    ci_1v2: '[0.6859, 0.7041]'\n27\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.4182\n28\t    ordinal_mae: 1.0163\n29\t  result_rationale: 'Rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 注入 mode-specific style artifacts（如固定的段落结构、\n30\t    总结性结尾句式），人为放大 depth signal 至 1v2 AUC=0.6957。在 median 档下，reviewer 注意到 rewrite mode\n31\t    的高 AUC 不能代表 canonical condition，要求论文明确将此实验定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"。2v3=0.5893\n32\t    < θ=0.60 确认 K*=2。 Reviewer 接受此实验作为 motivation 但要求所有 cross-model claims 基于 continuation\n33\t    mode。 与 continuation mode（1v2=0.6112）的 8.4pp gap 说明 generation mode 是显著 confound。\n34\t\n35\t    '\n36\t  tables:\n37\t  - name: 'Table 1 (partial): Pairwise AUC — MVP pilot'\n38\t    content: '| Pair | AUC    | 95% CI           | > θ=0.60? |\n39\t\n40\t      |------|--------|------------------|-----------|\n41\t\n42\t      | 0v1  | 0.9956 | [0.9946, 0.9965] | ✅ (+39.5pp) |\n43\t\n44\t      | 1v2  | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp)  |\n45\t\n46\t      | 2v3  | 0.5893 | [0.5795, 0.5991] | ❌           |\n47\t\n48\t      | 3v4  | 0.5434 | [0.5333, 0.5551] | ❌           |\n49\t\n50\t      | 4v5  | 0.5343 | [0.5238, 0.5448] | ❌           |\n51\t\n52\t      '\n53\t  figures_description:\n54\t  - AUC decay curve (rewrite mode) — Introduction motivation figure，展示 sharp K*=2\n55\t    boundary\n56\t  analysis: 'Reviewer A 接受 rewrite mode 作为 pilot。Reviewer B 质疑为何论文以 rewrite AUC 为\n57\t    headline 而非 continuation——cherry-picking 嫌疑。Median 档下需在论文中明确标注 mvp-001 为 pilot，所有\n58\t    headline number 基于 continuation mode。\n59\t\n60\t    '\n61\t- name: exp-001\n62\t  plan_id: exp_001_pythia_depth\n63\t  description: Pythia-1.4B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n64\t  expected_results:\n65\t    k_star: 2\n66\t    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9932\n67\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6539\n68\t    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5515\n69\t    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.5153\n70\t    pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5135\n71\t    ci_1v2: '[0.6454, 0.6630]'\n72\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.383\n73\t    ordinal_mae: 1.14\n74\t  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B 作为第一个 continuation mode 跨模型验证，1v2 AUC=0.6539 距 θ=0.60\n75\t    有 +4.5pp 余量，是 C4 web text 上 K*=2 的稳健证据。2v3 AUC=0.5515 远低于 θ， sharp boundary 明确。Median\n76\t    档下 reviewer 接受 K*=2 判定无争议（CI lower=0.6454 >> 0.60）， 但 Pythia-1.4B 代表性受限——较老架构、训练数据不同。Reviewer\n77\t    认为此结果 \"expected given information-theoretic intuition\"：递归生成快速退化是直觉合理的。 Pythia\n78\t    在 Code 域的 K*=1 结果（exp_code_pythia1b4）被 reviewer 用来论证 domain-specific competence\n79\t    的调制作用。\n80\t\n81\t    '\n82\t  tables:\n83\t  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Pythia-1.4B C4 continuation'\n84\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n85\t\n86\t      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n87\t\n88\t      | Pythia-1.4B | 0.993 | 0.654 | 0.552 | 0.515 | 0.514 | 2 |\n89\t\n90\t      '\n91\t  figures_description:\n92\t  - Pairwise AUC heatmap 中的一行，展示 sharp 0v1→1v2 drop 和 2v3+ plateau\n93\t  analysis: '稳健但不 exciting。Pythia 的较高 1v2 AUC (vs Qwen-cont 0.6112) 减少了 borderline\n94\t    concern。在 4-domain 框架下，Pythia 的 C4 K*=2 + Code K*=1 + arXiv K*=3 完整展现了 domain×competence\n95\t    interaction：code competence 不足导致未达 ceiling。\n96\t\n97\t    '\n98\t- name: exp-002\n99\t  plan_id: exp_002_olmo_depth\n100\t  description: OLMo-1B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n101\t  expected_results:\n102\t    k_star: 2\n103\t    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.997\n104\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6146\n105\t    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5497\n106\t    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.509\n107\t    pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5044\n108\t    ci_1v2: '[0.6045, 0.6247]'\n109\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3685\n110\t    ordinal_mae: 1.1813\n111\t  result_rationale: 'OLMo-1B 1v2 AUC=0.6146，CI lower=0.6045，余量 +0.45pp。比 Pythia 更边缘但仍\n112\t    pass。 Median 档下 reviewer 注意到 CI lower 只比 θ 高 0.45pp，但未被单独点名 （Qwen-cont 的 0.6015\n113\t    更 marginal 吸引了注意力）。OLMo 在 arXiv 上的 capacity failure (K*=1) 被 reviewer 视为 \"model\n114\t    competence prerequisite\" 的证据，与 Code 域 Pythia K*=1 形成类比：两者都是 domain-specific competence\n115\t    不足的例子。\n116\t\n117\t    '\n118\t  tables:\n119\t  - name: 'Table 2 (row): OLMo-1B C4 continuation'\n120\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n121\t\n122\t      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n123\t\n124\t      | OLMo-1B | 0.997 | 0.615 | 0.550 | 0.509 | 0.504 | 2 |\n125\t\n126\t      '\n127\t  figures_description:\n128\t  - Pairwise AUC heatmap 中的一行\n129\t  analysis: '与 Pythia 一致，增强跨模型证据。OLMo 3v4/4v5 接近 0.50 (chance)， 进一步确认 depth ≥3 后信号完全消失。OLMo\n130\t    无 Code 域数据（未测试）， 不影响 Code ceiling 论证。\n131\t\n132\t    '\n133\t- name: exp-003\n134\t  plan_id: exp_003_decoding_ablation\n135\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-1.5B decoding strategy ablation: greedy / nucleus p=0.9 /\n136\t    T=0.7 / T=1.2'\n137\t  expected_results:\n138\t    k_star: 2\n139\t    k_star_robust: true\n140\t    greedy_1v2_auc: 0.6892\n141\t    nuc09_1v2_auc: 0.6862\n142\t    t07_1v2_auc: 0.6885\n143\t    t12_1v2_auc: 0.7037\n144\t    auc_1v2_range: '[0.6862, 0.7037]'\n145\t    all_k_star_2: true\n146\t    nuc09_2v3_ci_upper: 0.601\n147\t  result_rationale: '四种解码策略下 K* 完全一致=2，AUC range < 2pp。解码策略不变性消除了 \"K*=2 是特定 sampling\n148\t    参数的 artifact\" 的质疑。但此实验在 Qwen rewrite mode 上做 （rewrite 的 higher baseline signal\n149\t    使 K*=2 更容易 robust），exp-020 在 Pythia continuation 上复制增强了说服力。在 4-domain context\n150\t    下，decoding invariance 为 \"domain ceiling 是 K* 主要决定因素\" 提供额外支持：如果 decoding 不影响 K*，\n151\t    则 domain structure 对 K* 的决定作用更突出。\n152\t\n153\t    '\n154\t  tables:\n155\t  - name: 'Table 3: Decoding strategy ablation'\n156\t    content: '| Decoding | 0v1 AUC | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n157\t\n158\t      |----------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\n159\t\n160\t      | greedy   | 0.9796  | 0.6892  | 0.5612  | 2   |\n161\t\n162\t      | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.9945 | 0.6862 | 0.5917 | 2 |\n163\t\n164\t      | T=0.7    | 0.9877  | 0.6885  | 0.5901  | 2   |\n165\t\n166\t      | T=1.2    | 0.9982  | 0.7037  | 0.5820  | 2   |\n167\t\n168\t      '\n169\t  figures_description:\n170\t  - Bar chart showing K* invariance across decoding strategies\n171\t  analysis: 'Decoding invariance 是 C1'' 的支柱。Median 档 reviewer 接受但权重较低 （\"somewhat expected\"）。配合\n172\t    exp-020 Pythia replication 形成完整论证。\n173\t\n174\t    '\n175\t- name: exp-004\n176\t  plan_id: exp_004_7b_crossscale\n177\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n178\t  expected_results:\n179\t    k_star: 2\n180\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6178\n181\t    ci_1v2: '[0.6079, 0.6261]'\n182\t    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.546\n183\t    ci_2v3_upper: 0.5594\n184\t    pairwise_auc_4v5_perm_p: 0.0676\n185\t  result_rationale: '7B scale 下 K*=2 与 1.5B 一致，CI lower=0.6079 > θ（余量 +0.79pp）。 Median\n186\t    档下 reviewer 接受 1.5B→7B scale invariance 但力度不足： 至少一个 reviewer 标记 \"≤8B is a significant\n187\t    limitation\"。14B (exp_14b_c4) 和 32B (exp_32b_c4) 数据用于回应此 concern。Qwen-7B 在 Code\n188\t    域的结果 （预测 K*=2 but marginal）进一步扩展此模型的 multi-domain profile。\n189\t\n190\t    '\n191\t  tables:\n192\t  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-7B C4 continuation'\n193\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n194\t\n195\t      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n196\t\n197\t      | Qwen2.5-7B | 0.964 | 0.618 | 0.546 | 0.523 | 0.509 | 2 |\n198\t\n199\t      '\n200\t  figures_description:\n201\t  - 'Scale comparison subplot: 1.5B vs 7B vs 14B pairwise AUC curves'\n202\t  analysis: 'Scale invariance 从 1.5B→14B 均确认 K*=2。如果 32B 也确认， rebuttal 中可有效回应 scale\n203\t    limitation concern。\n204\t\n205\t    '\n206\t- name: exp-005\n207\t  plan_id: exp_005_degradation\n208\t  description: Feature group ablation + degradation ordering analysis\n209\t  expected_results:\n210\t    cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_olmo: 0.95\n211\t    cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_qwen_cont: 0.9143\n212\t    cross_model_spearman_rho_olmo_qwen_cont: 0.85\n213\t    shared_top_discriminators: surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\n214\t    1v2_tau_weakness: 0.37\n215\t  result_rationale: 'Feature ordering 跨模型高度一致（ρ≥0.85），支持 depth signal 是 text-intrinsic。\n216\t    Median 档下 reviewer 接受 feature ranking consistency 但不视为独立贡献。 1v2 pair 的 feature\n217\t    importance 一致性最弱（τ~0.37），在 boundary pair 信号最微弱处 variance 大是合理的。Surprisal-based\n218\t    features 主导与 DPI 理论一致。 在 4-domain 扩展后，Code 域的 feature ranking 是否保持一致成为新的验证点： Code\n219\t    域 top features 同为 freq_entropy 和 surp_d1_mean，说明 feature ordering 在 programming\n220\t    language text 上也成立。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t  tables:\n224\t  - name: 'Table A2: Cross-model feature ranking Spearman ρ'\n225\t    content: '| Model Pair | Spearman ρ |\n226\t\n227\t      |------------|-----------|\n228\t\n229\t      | Pythia ↔ OLMo | 0.950 |\n230\t\n231\t      | Pythia ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.914 |\n232\t\n233\t      | OLMo ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.850 |\n234\t\n235\t      '\n236\t  figures_description:\n237\t  - Feature importance heatmap across models — Appendix\n238\t  analysis: 'Supporting evidence for text-intrinsic signal。不构成独立卖点。 Code 域 feature\n239\t    ordering consistency 作为 4-domain 扩展的补充证据。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t- name: exp-006\n243\t  plan_id: exp_006_graduated_filtering\n244\t  description: 'Downstream filtering evaluation: 6 strategies × 5 seeds, MMLU + HellaSwag'\n245\t  expected_results:\n246\t    binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941±0.0008\n247\t    binary_ours_hellaswag: 0.6701±0.0006\n248\t    no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865±0.0010\n249\t    no_filter_hellaswag: 0.6638±0.0008\n250\t    delta_mmlu_binary_vs_nofilter: '+0.0076'\n251\t    delta_hellaswag_binary_vs_nofilter: '+0.0063'\n252\t    base_model_mmlu: 0.6018\n253\t    graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892±0.0008\n254\t    dsir_mmlu: 0.5869±0.0003\n255\t  result_rationale: 'Binary-ours 在所有策略中最优，但 MMLU 增益仅 +0.76pp vs no-filter。 在 median\n256\t    档下，C3 的核心弱点被暴露：(a) MMLU Δ=0.76pp 被 reviewer 质疑 practical significance；(b) 所有策略都\n257\t    degrade vs base_model，说明 contaminated data 的 fundamental harm 无法被 filtering 完全消除；\n258\t    (c) Graduated α 单调递增确认 K*=2 boundary，但被质疑 circular reasoning； (d) DSIR 表现差是正面结果，但公平性被质疑。一位\n259\t    reviewer 认为 C3 negative results（Pythia exp-025, arXiv exp-026）削弱 practical relevance，\n260\t    要求 C3 降级为 \"case study\"。HellaSwag delta 在 median 档范围 [3.8, 6.1]pp 的中间值约 5.0pp——对应\n261\t    exp-009 dose-response 跨 ratio 的 consistent binary advantage。\n262\t\n263\t    '\n264\t  tables:\n265\t  - name: 'Table 5: Filtering strategy comparison (Qwen2.5-1.5B, 30% contamination)'\n266\t    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter |\n267\t\n268\t      |----------|------|-----------|-------------------|\n269\t\n270\t      | binary-ours | 0.5941±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0006 | +0.0076* |\n271\t\n272\t      | binary-Drayson | 0.5913±0.0009 | 0.6691±0.0004 | +0.0048* |\n273\t\n274\t      | surprisal | 0.5894±0.0009 | 0.6641±0.0006 | +0.0029 |\n275\t\n276\t      | graduated α=0.9 | 0.5892±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0007 | +0.0027 |\n277\t\n278\t      | DSIR | 0.5869±0.0003 | 0.6631±0.0007 | +0.0004 |\n279\t\n280\t      | no-filter | 0.5865±0.0010 | 0.6638±0.0008 | — |\n281\t\n282\t      | base (no contam.) | 0.6018 | 0.6821 | — |\n283\t\n284\t      '\n285\t  figures_description:\n286\t  - 'Bar chart: filtering strategies ranked by MMLU, with base_model reference line'\n287\t  - 'α sensitivity curve: graduated filtering MMLU as function of α'\n288\t  analysis: 'Median 档 reviewer 给 C3 substance score ~2.5-3.0。核心攻击：effect size 太小、\n289\t    binary > graduated 说明 K*-aware granularity 增量微弱。C3 需从 \"validation\" 降级为 \"case study\n290\t    / demonstration\"。\n291\t\n292\t    '\n293\t- name: exp-007\n294\t  plan_id: exp_007_bootstrap_ci\n295\t  description: K* sensitivity at θ=0.55/0.60/0.65/0.70 + bootstrap CI + permutation\n296\t    test\n297\t  expected_results:\n298\t    all_1v2_ci_lower_above_060: true\n299\t    most_marginal: Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015\n300\t    theta_055_k_star_distribution: all models K*=2 or K*=3\n301\t    theta_060_k_star_distribution: 7/8 K*=2, 1/8 K*=1 (Mistral)\n302\t    theta_065_k_star_distribution: 4-5/8 K*=2, rest K*=1\n303\t    theta_070_k_star_distribution: most K*=1\n304\t  result_rationale: 'θ-sensitivity 是 median 档的关键攻击面。θ=0.60 下 7/8 configurations K*=2\n305\t    被接受， 但 θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1 被 reviewer 放大：\"The finding is highly sensitive to threshold\n306\t    choice.\" Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被要求 sensitivity analysis 或额外 seeds 确认。Median\n307\t    档要求 θ=0.55-0.70 全谱 figure 在主文呈现。论文需正面呈现 K* 在 [0.55, 0.65] 范围内的稳定性，并以 Cohen''s\n308\t    h=0.20 和 AUC gap discontinuity 为 θ=0.60 选择辩护。Permutation test p<0.001 提供统计支持，但\n309\t    reviewer 指出 \"statistical significance ≠ practical significance\"。在 4-domain 扩展后，\n310\t    θ-sensitivity 需分域呈现：arXiv 在 θ=0.65 仍 K*=3（2v3 AUC=0.6427 >> 0.65）， Code 域在 θ=0.65\n311\t    下 Qwen-1.5B 仍 K*=2（1v2=0.7382 >> 0.65）但 Qwen-7B 变为 K*=1（marginal）。\n312\t\n313\t    '\n314\t  tables:\n315\t  - name: 'Table 4: K* sensitivity to threshold θ (C4 domain)'\n316\t    content: '| θ | K*=1 | K*=2 | K*=3 |\n317\t\n318\t      |------|------|------|------|\n319\t\n320\t      | 0.55 | 0/8  | 7/8  | 1/8  |\n321\t\n322\t      | 0.60 | 1/8  | 7/8  | 0/8  |\n323\t\n324\t      | 0.65 | 3-4/8 | 4-5/8 | 0/8 |\n325\t\n326\t      | 0.70 | 6-7/8 | 1-2/8 | 0/8 |\n327\t\n328\t      '\n329\t  figures_description:\n330\t  - '主文 Figure: θ-sensitivity heatmap (4 domains × θ range), showing K* stability\n331\t    in [0.55, 0.65]'\n332\t  - AUC gap discontinuity plot at K* boundary pair\n333\t  analysis: 'θ-sensitivity 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 \"fair analysis\" 但 robustness concern\n334\t    未完全消除。关键辩护：1v2 vs 2v3 的 AUC gap 远大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range。 4-domain 呈现增强说服力——arXiv\n335\t    和 Code 的 θ-robust 区间更宽。\n336\t\n337\t    '\n338\t- name: exp-008\n339\t  plan_id: exp_008_retrain_chain_v2\n340\t  description: 'Retrain-chain ecological validity: Pythia-1.4B LoRA, C4 5K docs, depth\n341\t    0-4'\n342\t  expected_results:\n343\t    k_star: '>=4'\n344\t    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9847\n345\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.9484\n346\t    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.8888\n347\t    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.7982\n348\t  result_rationale: 'Retrain-chain K*≥4 与 prompt-chain K*=2 的巨大差异来源于 LoRA fine-tune\n349\t    每代引入 cumulative model artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias）。在 median\n350\t    档下 reviewer 接受 \"prompt-chain isolates text-intrinsic degradation\"，但要求论文更 prominently\n351\t    讨论 retrain-chain 的 higher detectability。现在有 depth-7 数据 （Qwen K*=7, Pythia K*=7）和\n352\t    two-family cross-validation，retrain-chain 的 evidence chain 大幅增强。一个 reviewer 正面解读：\"retrain-chain\n353\t    K*=7 vs prompt-chain K*=2 shows the method scales to deeper chains, and prompt-chain\n354\t    K*=2 is the conservative lower bound.\" 另一个 reviewer 质疑 \"LoRA rank=16 引入的 artifacts\n355\t    是 setup-specific 的，不代表 full fine-tune 或 RLHF contamination。\"\n356\t\n357\t    '\n358\t  tables:\n359\t  - name: 'Table 6: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison'\n360\t    content: '| Pair | Prompt-chain AUC | Retrain-chain AUC (depth 4) | Retrain-chain\n361\t      AUC (depth 7) |\n362\t\n363\t      |------|-----------------|---------------------------|---------------------------|\n364\t\n365\t      | 0v1  | 0.993 | 0.985 | 0.984 |\n366\t\n367\t      | 1v2  | 0.654 | 0.948 | 0.897 |\n368\t\n369\t      | 2v3  | 0.552 | 0.889 | 0.810 |\n370\t\n371\t      | 3v4  | 0.515 | 0.798 | 0.760 |\n372\t\n373\t      | 4v5  | — | — | 0.746 |\n374\t\n375\t      | 5v6  | — | — | 0.702 |\n376\t\n377\t      | 6v7  | — | — | 0.641 |\n378\t\n379\t      '\n380\t  figures_description:\n381\t  - 'Dual-panel AUC decay: prompt-chain (sharp drop) vs retrain-chain (gradual decay\n382\t    to depth 7)'\n383\t  analysis: 'Retrain K*=7 (two families, consistent) 是 rebuttal 级别证据。 Median 档 reviewer\n384\t    肯定 ecological validity 贡献但要求讨论 \"real-world contamination likely falls between\n385\t    prompt-chain and retrain-chain\"。\n386\t\n387\t    '\n388\t- name: exp-009\n389\t  plan_id: exp_009_dose_50pct\n390\t  description: 'Contamination dose-response: 10%/30%/50% ratio × 3 strategies × 5\n391\t    seeds'\n392\t  expected_results:\n393\t    binary_consistently_best: true\n394\t    graduated_equals_no_filter: true\n395\t    hellaswag_binary_significant_all_ratios: true\n396\t    mmlu_binary_30pct_p: 0.074\n397\t    effect_size_increases_with_contamination: true\n398\t    hellaswag_delta_10pct: +0.38pp\n399\t    hellaswag_delta_30pct: +0.61pp\n400\t    hellaswag_delta_50pct: +0.51pp\n401\t  result_rationale: 'Dose-response 确认 binary filtering 在所有 contamination ratio 下一致最优，\n402\t    graduated filtering 崩溃至 no-filter 水平。HellaSwag 显著（p≤0.004 at all ratios） 但 MMLU\n403\t    在 30% ratio 下 p=0.074 不显著，被 reviewer 攻击 \"inconsistent significance across benchmarks\"。Effect\n404\t    size 随 contamination ratio 增加但绝对值仍小。 一位 reviewer 认为这些 C3 negative results（加上 exp-025/026\n405\t    null results） 削弱 practical relevance：K* 虽然能 characterize discriminability boundary，\n406\t    但无法 reliably 转化为 filtering 收益。\n407\t\n408\t    '\n409\t  tables:\n410\t  - name: 'Table 7: Dose-response analysis (HellaSwag)'\n411\t    content: '| Ratio | binary vs no-filter Δ | p-value |\n412\t\n413\t      |-------|----------------------|---------|\n414\t\n415\t      | 10%   | +0.0038              | 0.0017  |\n416\t\n417\t      | 30%   | +0.0061              | 0.0036  |\n418\t\n419\t      | 50%   | +0.0051              | <0.001  |\n420\t\n421\t      '\n422\t  figures_description:\n423\t  - 'Line plot: HellaSwag as function of contamination ratio, 3 strategies, with significance\n424\t    markers'\n425\t  analysis: 'Binary filtering dose-response consistency 是 C3 最强证据。 但 graduated=no-filter\n426\t    同时说明 K*-aware graduated curation 无增量价值。 C3 reviewer 评分 2.5-3.0。\n427\t\n428\t    '\n429\t- name: exp-010\n430\t  plan_id: exp_010_ordinal_baseline\n431\t  description: CORAL vs multiclass LightGBM vs ordinal logistic regression\n432\t  expected_results:\n433\t    obd_lgbm_best_accuracy: 0.4229\n434\t    multiclass_lgbm_accuracy: 0.4182\n435\t    ordinal_logreg_best_tau: 0.563\n436\t    obd_lgbm_best_mae: 0.9836\n437\t  result_rationale: 'OBD-LightGBM 略优于 multiclass LightGBM（Δacc < 0.5pp），ordinal logistic\n438\t    regression MAE 最低但 accuracy 最差。Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注——\"implementation detail,\n439\t    not a contribution\"。Ordinal structure 为 \"depth is ordinal\" framing 提供小幅支持。\n440\t\n441\t    '\n442\t  tables:\n443\t  - name: 'Table A3: Classifier comparison'\n444\t    content: '| Method | Acc | MAE | τ_b | Mean PW-AUC |\n445\t\n446\t      |--------|-----|-----|-----|-------------|\n447\t\n448\t      | OBD-LightGBM | 0.423 | 0.984 | 0.552 | 0.621 |\n449\t\n450\t      | Multiclass-LightGBM | 0.418 | 1.016 | 0.537 | 0.625 |\n451\t\n452\t      | Ordinal LogReg | 0.364 | 0.911 | 0.563 | 0.502 |\n453\t\n454\t      '\n455\t  figures_description: []\n456\t  analysis: Appendix material。Median 档 reviewer 不质疑也不 highlight。\n457\t- name: exp-011\n458\t  plan_id: exp_011_llm_zeroshot\n459\t  description: GPT-5.5 / Claude Opus 4.6 zero-shot depth estimation baseline\n460\t  expected_results:\n461\t    gpt55_5class_acc: 0.332\n462\t    claude_5class_acc: 0.331\n463\t    gpt55_binary_acc: 0.878\n464\t    claude_binary_acc: 0.882\n465\t    odb_baseline_5class_acc: 0.386\n466\t  result_rationale: 'Frontier LLMs 在 5-class depth estimation 上不如 OBD-LightGBM（33%\n467\t    vs 39%）， 但 binary detection 高达 88%。证明 depth estimation 需要 specialized features。\n468\t    Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价 \"Good to include\"，但指出 OBD 也只有 39% accuracy， \"both methods\n469\t    are poor at fine-grained depth estimation\"。McNemar test non-significant (p~0.07-0.08)\n470\t    被注意——OBD 优势不显著。\n471\t\n472\t    '\n473\t  tables:\n474\t  - name: 'Table 8: LLM zero-shot vs OBD baseline'\n475\t    content: '| Method | 5-class Acc | MAE | Binary Acc |\n476\t\n477\t      |--------|------------|-----|-----------|\n478\t\n479\t      | GPT-5.5 | 0.332 | 1.102 | 0.878 |\n480\t\n481\t      | Claude Opus 4.6 | 0.331 | 1.150 | 0.882 |\n482\t\n483\t      | OBD-LightGBM | 0.386 | 1.107 | — |\n484\t\n485\t      '\n486\t  figures_description:\n487\t  - 'Per-depth accuracy heatmap: LLMs vs OBD, showing LLM failure at depth 1-4'\n488\t  analysis: Median 档 reviewer 正面评价但 McNemar non-significant 削弱 claim。\n489\t- name: exp-012\n490\t  plan_id: exp_012_binary_confidence\n491\t  description: DivEye/Binoculars binary detector confidence as depth proxy\n492\t  expected_results:\n493\t    binary_detector_kstar: 1\n494\t    obd_kstar: 2\n495\t    spearman_rho_range: 0.06-0.46\n496\t    auc_non_monotonic: true\n497\t    six_class_accuracy_max: 0.199\n498\t  result_rationale: 'Binary detectors K*≈1 vs OBD K*=2，6-class accuracy 接近 random。\n499\t    直接支持 \"binary confidence ≠ depth\" 的 claim。Median 档下 reviewer 接受结论， 但建议加入 watermark-based\n500\t    或 learned detectors 作为 baseline。 在 4-domain 框架下，binary detector 在 Code 域同样 K*≈1，"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4c4b2e3-74d5-42da-8308-39f7eee2e53c","uuid":"7413baef-6d0a-4fc6-bf81-7b3b935a5900","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:01:58.113Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260519T090934/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'C1'' 核心成立但 claims 需降级。Domain ceiling 从 \"predictive framework\"\n  调整为 \"empirical tendency with domain×competence interaction\"：中间复杂度域（C4, Code） 的 K*\n  受 model domain-specific competence 调制，极端域（Wiki, arXiv）稳健。 Code 域叙事从 \"ceiling=2 cross-family\n  confirmed\" 改为 \"ceiling=2 observed in models with adequate code pretraining (Qwen,\n  LLaMA); insufficient code competence yields K*=1 (Pythia, Mistral), consistent with\n  C4 Mistral pattern\"。C3 的 scope 在 Limitations 中更显著呈现，承认 filtering advantage 限于 homogeneous\n  web text + 单一 base model (Qwen-1.5B)，不泛化到 arXiv 或其他 base models。补充实验：可能 需要 arXiv\n  cross-scorer bootstrap CI 的完整呈现、θ-sensitivity full sweep figure。 目标 EMNLP Findings\n  或 borderline Main。审稿人对 Code 域结果的解读分裂： Reviewer A 认为 3/5 models at ceiling 已足够 establish\n  pattern，Reviewer B 认为 2/5 failure 暗示 ceiling 框架 overfits 已有数据。arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer\n  K*=3→2 的下降被一位审稿人视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的证据。θ-sensitivity 被要求做更详细分析（θ=0.55-0.70\n  全谱呈现）。整体 excitement 3.3-3.7， EMNLP Main accept prob 0.25-0.50。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: mvp-001\n  plan_id: mvp_pilot_sat_v1\n  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct rewrite mode pilot, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9956\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6957\n    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5893\n    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.5434\n    pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5343\n    ci_1v2: '[0.6859, 0.7041]'\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.4182\n    ordinal_mae: 1.0163\n  result_rationale: 'Rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 注入 mode-specific style artifacts（如固定的段落结构、\n    总结性结尾句式），人为放大 depth signal 至 1v2 AUC=0.6957。在 median 档下，reviewer 注意到 rewrite mode\n    的高 AUC 不能代表 canonical condition，要求论文明确将此实验定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"。2v3=0.5893\n    < θ=0.60 确认 K*=2。 Reviewer 接受此实验作为 motivation 但要求所有 cross-model claims 基于 continuation\n    mode。 与 continuation mode（1v2=0.6112）的 8.4pp gap 说明 generation mode 是显著 confound。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1 (partial): Pairwise AUC — MVP pilot'\n    content: '| Pair | AUC    | 95% CI           | > θ=0.60? |\n\n      |------|--------|------------------|-----------|\n\n      | 0v1  | 0.9956 | [0.9946, 0.9965] | ✅ (+39.5pp) |\n\n      | 1v2  | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp)  |\n\n      | 2v3  | 0.5893 | [0.5795, 0.5991] | ❌           |\n\n      | 3v4  | 0.5434 | [0.5333, 0.5551] | ❌           |\n\n      | 4v5  | 0.5343 | [0.5238, 0.5448] | ❌           |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - AUC decay curve (rewrite mode) — Introduction motivation figure，展示 sharp K*=2\n    boundary\n  analysis: 'Reviewer A 接受 rewrite mode 作为 pilot。Reviewer B 质疑为何论文以 rewrite AUC 为\n    headline 而非 continuation——cherry-picking 嫌疑。Median 档下需在论文中明确标注 mvp-001 为 pilot，所有\n    headline number 基于 continuation mode。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-001\n  plan_id: exp_001_pythia_depth\n  description: Pythia-1.4B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9932\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6539\n    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5515\n    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.5153\n    pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5135\n    ci_1v2: '[0.6454, 0.6630]'\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.383\n    ordinal_mae: 1.14\n  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B 作为第一个 continuation mode 跨模型验证，1v2 AUC=0.6539 距 θ=0.60\n    有 +4.5pp 余量，是 C4 web text 上 K*=2 的稳健证据。2v3 AUC=0.5515 远低于 θ， sharp boundary 明确。Median\n    档下 reviewer 接受 K*=2 判定无争议（CI lower=0.6454 >> 0.60）， 但 Pythia-1.4B 代表性受限——较老架构、训练数据不同。Reviewer\n    认为此结果 \"expected given information-theoretic intuition\"：递归生成快速退化是直觉合理的。 Pythia\n    在 Code 域的 K*=1 结果（exp_code_pythia1b4）被 reviewer 用来论证 domain-specific competence\n    的调制作用。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Pythia-1.4B C4 continuation'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n\n      | Pythia-1.4B | 0.993 | 0.654 | 0.552 | 0.515 | 0.514 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Pairwise AUC heatmap 中的一行，展示 sharp 0v1→1v2 drop 和 2v3+ plateau\n  analysis: '稳健但不 exciting。Pythia 的较高 1v2 AUC (vs Qwen-cont 0.6112) 减少了 borderline\n    concern。在 4-domain 框架下，Pythia 的 C4 K*=2 + Code K*=1 + arXiv K*=3 完整展现了 domain×competence\n    interaction：code competence 不足导致未达 ceiling。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-002\n  plan_id: exp_002_olmo_depth\n  description: OLMo-1B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.997\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6146\n    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5497\n    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.509\n    pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5044\n    ci_1v2: '[0.6045, 0.6247]'\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3685\n    ordinal_mae: 1.1813\n  result_rationale: 'OLMo-1B 1v2 AUC=0.6146，CI lower=0.6045，余量 +0.45pp。比 Pythia 更边缘但仍\n    pass。 Median 档下 reviewer 注意到 CI lower 只比 θ 高 0.45pp，但未被单独点名 （Qwen-cont 的 0.6015\n    更 marginal 吸引了注意力）。OLMo 在 arXiv 上的 capacity failure (K*=1) 被 reviewer 视为 \"model\n    competence prerequisite\" 的证据，与 Code 域 Pythia K*=1 形成类比：两者都是 domain-specific competence\n    不足的例子。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (row): OLMo-1B C4 continuation'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n\n      | OLMo-1B | 0.997 | 0.615 | 0.550 | 0.509 | 0.504 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Pairwise AUC heatmap 中的一行\n  analysis: '与 Pythia 一致，增强跨模型证据。OLMo 3v4/4v5 接近 0.50 (chance)， 进一步确认 depth ≥3 后信号完全消失。OLMo\n    无 Code 域数据（未测试）， 不影响 Code ceiling 论证。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-003\n  plan_id: exp_003_decoding_ablation\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-1.5B decoding strategy ablation: greedy / nucleus p=0.9 /\n    T=0.7 / T=1.2'\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    k_star_robust: true\n    greedy_1v2_auc: 0.6892\n    nuc09_1v2_auc: 0.6862\n    t07_1v2_auc: 0.6885\n    t12_1v2_auc: 0.7037\n    auc_1v2_range: '[0.6862, 0.7037]'\n    all_k_star_2: true\n    nuc09_2v3_ci_upper: 0.601\n  result_rationale: '四种解码策略下 K* 完全一致=2，AUC range < 2pp。解码策略不变性消除了 \"K*=2 是特定 sampling\n    参数的 artifact\" 的质疑。但此实验在 Qwen rewrite mode 上做 （rewrite 的 higher baseline signal\n    使 K*=2 更容易 robust），exp-020 在 Pythia continuation 上复制增强了说服力。在 4-domain context\n    下，decoding invariance 为 \"domain ceiling 是 K* 主要决定因素\" 提供额外支持：如果 decoding 不影响 K*，\n    则 domain structure 对 K* 的决定作用更突出。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Decoding strategy ablation'\n    content: '| Decoding | 0v1 AUC | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n\n      |----------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\n\n      | greedy   | 0.9796  | 0.6892  | 0.5612  | 2   |\n\n      | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.9945 | 0.6862 | 0.5917 | 2 |\n\n      | T=0.7    | 0.9877  | 0.6885  | 0.5901  | 2   |\n\n      | T=1.2    | 0.9982  | 0.7037  | 0.5820  | 2   |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Bar chart showing K* invariance across decoding strategies\n  analysis: 'Decoding invariance 是 C1'' 的支柱。Median 档 reviewer 接受但权重较低 （\"somewhat expected\"）。配合\n    exp-020 Pythia replication 形成完整论证。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-004\n  plan_id: exp_004_7b_crossscale\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6178\n    ci_1v2: '[0.6079, 0.6261]'\n    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.546\n    ci_2v3_upper: 0.5594\n    pairwise_auc_4v5_perm_p: 0.0676\n  result_rationale: '7B scale 下 K*=2 与 1.5B 一致，CI lower=0.6079 > θ（余量 +0.79pp）。 Median\n    档下 reviewer 接受 1.5B→7B scale invariance 但力度不足： 至少一个 reviewer 标记 \"≤8B is a significant\n    limitation\"。14B (exp_14b_c4) 和 32B (exp_32b_c4) 数据用于回应此 concern。Qwen-7B 在 Code\n    域的结果 （预测 K*=2 but marginal）进一步扩展此模型的 multi-domain profile。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-7B C4 continuation'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n\n      | Qwen2.5-7B | 0.964 | 0.618 | 0.546 | 0.523 | 0.509 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scale comparison subplot: 1.5B vs 7B vs 14B pairwise AUC curves'\n  analysis: 'Scale invariance 从 1.5B→14B 均确认 K*=2。如果 32B 也确认， rebuttal 中可有效回应 scale\n    limitation concern。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-005\n  plan_id: exp_005_degradation\n  description: Feature group ablation + degradation ordering analysis\n  expected_results:\n    cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_olmo: 0.95\n    cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_qwen_cont: 0.9143\n    cross_model_spearman_rho_olmo_qwen_cont: 0.85\n    shared_top_discriminators: surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\n    1v2_tau_weakness: 0.37\n  result_rationale: 'Feature ordering 跨模型高度一致（ρ≥0.85），支持 depth signal 是 text-intrinsic。\n    Median 档下 reviewer 接受 feature ranking consistency 但不视为独立贡献。 1v2 pair 的 feature\n    importance 一致性最弱（τ~0.37），在 boundary pair 信号最微弱处 variance 大是合理的。Surprisal-based\n    features 主导与 DPI 理论一致。 在 4-domain 扩展后，Code 域的 feature ranking 是否保持一致成为新的验证点： Code\n    域 top features 同为 freq_entropy 和 surp_d1_mean，说明 feature ordering 在 programming\n    language text 上也成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A2: Cross-model feature ranking Spearman ρ'\n    content: '| Model Pair | Spearman ρ |\n\n      |------------|-----------|\n\n      | Pythia ↔ OLMo | 0.950 |\n\n      | Pythia ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.914 |\n\n      | OLMo ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.850 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Feature importance heatmap across models — Appendix\n  analysis: 'Supporting evidence for text-intrinsic signal。不构成独立卖点。 Code 域 feature\n    ordering consistency 作为 4-domain 扩展的补充证据。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-006\n  plan_id: exp_006_graduated_filtering\n  description: 'Downstream filtering evaluation: 6 strategies × 5 seeds, MMLU + HellaSwag'\n  expected_results:\n    binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941±0.0008\n    binary_ours_hellaswag: 0.6701±0.0006\n    no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865±0.0010\n    no_filter_hellaswag: 0.6638±0.0008\n    delta_mmlu_binary_vs_nofilter: '+0.0076'\n    delta_hellaswag_binary_vs_nofilter: '+0.0063'\n    base_model_mmlu: 0.6018\n    graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892±0.0008\n    dsir_mmlu: 0.5869±0.0003\n  result_rationale: 'Binary-ours 在所有策略中最优，但 MMLU 增益仅 +0.76pp vs no-filter。 在 median\n    档下，C3 的核心弱点被暴露：(a) MMLU Δ=0.76pp 被 reviewer 质疑 practical significance；(b) 所有策略都\n    degrade vs base_model，说明 contaminated data 的 fundamental harm 无法被 filtering 完全消除；\n    (c) Graduated α 单调递增确认 K*=2 boundary，但被质疑 circular reasoning； (d) DSIR 表现差是正面结果，但公平性被质疑。一位\n    reviewer 认为 C3 negative results（Pythia exp-025, arXiv exp-026）削弱 practical relevance，\n    要求 C3 降级为 \"case study\"。HellaSwag delta 在 median 档范围 [3.8, 6.1]pp 的中间值约 5.0pp——对应\n    exp-009 dose-response 跨 ratio 的 consistent binary advantage。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Filtering strategy comparison (Qwen2.5-1.5B, 30% contamination)'\n    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter |\n\n      |----------|------|-----------|-------------------|\n\n      | binary-ours | 0.5941±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0006 | +0.0076* |\n\n      | binary-Drayson | 0.5913±0.0009 | 0.6691±0.0004 | +0.0048* |\n\n      | surprisal | 0.5894±0.0009 | 0.6641±0.0006 | +0.0029 |\n\n      | graduated α=0.9 | 0.5892±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0007 | +0.0027 |\n\n      | DSIR | 0.5869±0.0003 | 0.6631±0.0007 | +0.0004 |\n\n      | no-filter | 0.5865±0.0010 | 0.6638±0.0008 | — |\n\n      | base (no contam.) | 0.6018 | 0.6821 | — |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: filtering strategies ranked by MMLU, with base_model reference line'\n  - 'α sensitivity curve: graduated filtering MMLU as function of α'\n  analysis: 'Median 档 reviewer 给 C3 substance score ~2.5-3.0。核心攻击：effect size 太小、\n    binary > graduated 说明 K*-aware granularity 增量微弱。C3 需从 \"validation\" 降级为 \"case study\n    / demonstration\"。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-007\n  plan_id: exp_007_bootstrap_ci\n  description: K* sensitivity at θ=0.55/0.60/0.65/0.70 + bootstrap CI + permutation\n    test\n  expected_results:\n    all_1v2_ci_lower_above_060: true\n    most_marginal: Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015\n    theta_055_k_star_distribution: all models K*=2 or K*=3\n    theta_060_k_star_distribution: 7/8 K*=2, 1/8 K*=1 (Mistral)\n    theta_065_k_star_distribution: 4-5/8 K*=2, rest K*=1\n    theta_070_k_star_distribution: most K*=1\n  result_rationale: 'θ-sensitivity 是 median 档的关键攻击面。θ=0.60 下 7/8 configurations K*=2\n    被接受， 但 θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1 被 reviewer 放大：\"The finding is highly sensitive to threshold\n    choice.\" Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被要求 sensitivity analysis 或额外 seeds 确认。Median\n    档要求 θ=0.55-0.70 全谱 figure 在主文呈现。论文需正面呈现 K* 在 [0.55, 0.65] 范围内的稳定性，并以 Cohen''s\n    h=0.20 和 AUC gap discontinuity 为 θ=0.60 选择辩护。Permutation test p<0.001 提供统计支持，但\n    reviewer 指出 \"statistical significance ≠ practical significance\"。在 4-domain 扩展后，\n    θ-sensitivity 需分域呈现：arXiv 在 θ=0.65 仍 K*=3（2v3 AUC=0.6427 >> 0.65）， Code 域在 θ=0.65\n    下 Qwen-1.5B 仍 K*=2（1v2=0.7382 >> 0.65）但 Qwen-7B 变为 K*=1（marginal）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: K* sensitivity to threshold θ (C4 domain)'\n    content: '| θ | K*=1 | K*=2 | K*=3 |\n\n      |------|------|------|------|\n\n      | 0.55 | 0/8  | 7/8  | 1/8  |\n\n      | 0.60 | 1/8  | 7/8  | 0/8  |\n\n      | 0.65 | 3-4/8 | 4-5/8 | 0/8 |\n\n      | 0.70 | 6-7/8 | 1-2/8 | 0/8 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - '主文 Figure: θ-sensitivity heatmap (4 domains × θ range), showing K* stability\n    in [0.55, 0.65]'\n  - AUC gap discontinuity plot at K* boundary pair\n  analysis: 'θ-sensitivity 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 \"fair analysis\" 但 robustness concern\n    未完全消除。关键辩护：1v2 vs 2v3 的 AUC gap 远大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range。 4-domain 呈现增强说服力——arXiv\n    和 Code 的 θ-robust 区间更宽。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-008\n  plan_id: exp_008_retrain_chain_v2\n  description: 'Retrain-chain ecological validity: Pythia-1.4B LoRA, C4 5K docs, depth\n    0-4'\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: '>=4'\n    pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9847\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.9484\n    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.8888\n    pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.7982\n  result_rationale: 'Retrain-chain K*≥4 与 prompt-chain K*=2 的巨大差异来源于 LoRA fine-tune\n    每代引入 cumulative model artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias）。在 median\n    档下 reviewer 接受 \"prompt-chain isolates text-intrinsic degradation\"，但要求论文更 prominently\n    讨论 retrain-chain 的 higher detectability。现在有 depth-7 数据 （Qwen K*=7, Pythia K*=7）和\n    two-family cross-validation，retrain-chain 的 evidence chain 大幅增强。一个 reviewer 正面解读：\"retrain-chain\n    K*=7 vs prompt-chain K*=2 shows the method scales to deeper chains, and prompt-chain\n    K*=2 is the conservative lower bound.\" 另一个 reviewer 质疑 \"LoRA rank=16 引入的 artifacts\n    是 setup-specific 的，不代表 full fine-tune 或 RLHF contamination。\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison'\n    content: '| Pair | Prompt-chain AUC | Retrain-chain AUC (depth 4) | Retrain-chain\n      AUC (depth 7) |\n\n      |------|-----------------|---------------------------|---------------------------|\n\n      | 0v1  | 0.993 | 0.985 | 0.984 |\n\n      | 1v2  | 0.654 | 0.948 | 0.897 |\n\n      | 2v3  | 0.552 | 0.889 | 0.810 |\n\n      | 3v4  | 0.515 | 0.798 | 0.760 |\n\n      | 4v5  | — | — | 0.746 |\n\n      | 5v6  | — | — | 0.702 |\n\n      | 6v7  | — | — | 0.641 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-panel AUC decay: prompt-chain (sharp drop) vs retrain-chain (gradual decay\n    to depth 7)'\n  analysis: 'Retrain K*=7 (two families, consistent) 是 rebuttal 级别证据。 Median 档 reviewer\n    肯定 ecological validity 贡献但要求讨论 \"real-world contamination likely falls between\n    prompt-chain and retrain-chain\"。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-009\n  plan_id: exp_009_dose_50pct\n  description: 'Contamination dose-response: 10%/30%/50% ratio × 3 strategies × 5\n    seeds'\n  expected_results:\n    binary_consistently_best: true\n    graduated_equals_no_filter: true\n    hellaswag_binary_significant_all_ratios: true\n    mmlu_binary_30pct_p: 0.074\n    effect_size_increases_with_contamination: true\n    hellaswag_delta_10pct: +0.38pp\n    hellaswag_delta_30pct: +0.61pp\n    hellaswag_delta_50pct: +0.51pp\n  result_rationale: 'Dose-response 确认 binary filtering 在所有 contamination ratio 下一致最优，\n    graduated filtering 崩溃至 no-filter 水平。HellaSwag 显著（p≤0.004 at all ratios） 但 MMLU\n    在 30% ratio 下 p=0.074 不显著，被 reviewer 攻击 \"inconsistent significance across benchmarks\"。Effect\n    size 随 contamination ratio 增加但绝对值仍小。 一位 reviewer 认为这些 C3 negative results（加上 exp-025/026\n    null results） 削弱 practical relevance：K* 虽然能 characterize discriminability boundary，\n    但无法 reliably 转化为 filtering 收益。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Dose-response analysis (HellaSwag)'\n    content: '| Ratio | binary vs no-filter Δ | p-value |\n\n      |-------|----------------------|---------|\n\n      | 10%   | +0.0038              | 0.0017  |\n\n      | 30%   | +0.0061              | 0.0036  |\n\n      | 50%   | +0.0051              | <0.001  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: HellaSwag as function of contamination ratio, 3 strategies, with significance\n    markers'\n  analysis: 'Binary filtering dose-response consistency 是 C3 最强证据。 但 graduated=no-filter\n    同时说明 K*-aware graduated curation 无增量价值。 C3 reviewer 评分 2.5-3.0。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-010\n  plan_id: exp_010_ordinal_baseline\n  description: CORAL vs multiclass LightGBM vs ordinal logistic regression\n  expected_results:\n    obd_lgbm_best_accuracy: 0.4229\n    multiclass_lgbm_accuracy: 0.4182\n    ordinal_logreg_best_tau: 0.563\n    obd_lgbm_best_mae: 0.9836\n  result_rationale: 'OBD-LightGBM 略优于 multiclass LightGBM（Δacc < 0.5pp），ordinal logistic\n    regression MAE 最低但 accuracy 最差。Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注——\"implementation detail,\n    not a contribution\"。Ordinal structure 为 \"depth is ordinal\" framing 提供小幅支持。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A3: Classifier comparison'\n    content: '| Method | Acc | MAE | τ_b | Mean PW-AUC |\n\n      |--------|-----|-----|-----|-------------|\n\n      | OBD-LightGBM | 0.423 | 0.984 | 0.552 | 0.621 |\n\n      | Multiclass-LightGBM | 0.418 | 1.016 | 0.537 | 0.625 |\n\n      | Ordinal LogReg | 0.364 | 0.911 | 0.563 | 0.502 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Appendix material。Median 档 reviewer 不质疑也不 highlight。\n- name: exp-011\n  plan_id: exp_011_llm_zeroshot\n  description: GPT-5.5 / Claude Opus 4.6 zero-shot depth estimation baseline\n  expected_results:\n    gpt55_5class_acc: 0.332\n    claude_5class_acc: 0.331\n    gpt55_binary_acc: 0.878\n    claude_binary_acc: 0.882\n    odb_baseline_5class_acc: 0.386\n  result_rationale: 'Frontier LLMs 在 5-class depth estimation 上不如 OBD-LightGBM（33%\n    vs 39%）， 但 binary detection 高达 88%。证明 depth estimation 需要 specialized features。\n    Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价 \"Good to include\"，但指出 OBD 也只有 39% accuracy， \"both methods\n    are poor at fine-grained depth estimation\"。McNemar test non-significant (p~0.07-0.08)\n    被注意——OBD 优势不显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: LLM zero-shot vs OBD baseline'\n    content: '| Method | 5-class Acc | MAE | Binary Acc |\n\n      |--------|------------|-----|-----------|\n\n      | GPT-5.5 | 0.332 | 1.102 | 0.878 |\n\n      | Claude Opus 4.6 | 0.331 | 1.150 | 0.882 |\n\n      | OBD-LightGBM | 0.386 | 1.107 | — |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-depth accuracy heatmap: LLMs vs OBD, showing LLM failure at depth 1-4'\n  analysis: Median 档 reviewer 正面评价但 McNemar non-significant 削弱 claim。\n- name: 