    | Qwen-cont → OLMo | 80% |\n550\t\n551\t      | Qwen-rw → Pythia | 63% |\n552\t\n553\t      | Qwen-rw → OLMo | 61% |\n554\t\n555\t      '\n556\t  figures_description:\n557\t  - 4×4 transfer heatmap in main text\n558\t  analysis: 'C1'' strongest supporting evidence 之一。Transfer > 80% 在 continuation mode\n559\t    下 消除 scorer bias 质疑。\n560\t\n561\t    '\n562\t- name: exp-014\n563\t  plan_id: ''\n564\t  description: 'Naturalistic validation: Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot depth prediction'\n565\t  expected_results:\n566\t    status: planned_not_executed\n567\t    predicted_depth_distribution:\n568\t      depth_0: 60-75%\n569\t      depth_1: 15-25%\n570\t      depth_2_plus: 5-15%\n571\t    correlation_with_alignscore: Spearman ρ=0.15-0.30\n572\t    correlation_with_vocab_richness: Spearman ρ=0.20-0.35\n573\t  result_rationale: 'Naturalistic validation 未执行（P2 priority）。如果执行，预期 Common Crawl\n574\t    中 约 25-40% 文本被预测为 depth ≥1，与外部估计一致。但 ground truth 缺失使此实验 无法做定量验证。Median 档 reviewer\n575\t    不因缺失严重扣分，但 1 个 reviewer 建议 \"a naturalistic study would strengthen practical relevance\"，\n576\t    特别是在 C3 negative results 削弱 practical motivation 之后。\n577\t\n578\t    '\n579\t  tables: []\n580\t  figures_description: []\n581\t  analysis: 未执行。作为 future work 出现在 reviewer comments 中。\n582\t- name: exp-015\n583\t  plan_id: exp_015_neural_probe\n584\t  description: Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B embeddings + MLP probe vs 15D features\n585\t  expected_results:\n586\t    pythia_k_star_neural: 2\n587\t    olmo_k_star_neural: 2\n588\t    qwen_cont_k_star_neural: 3\n589\t    qwen_cont_2v3_neural_auc: 0.616\n590\t    qwen_cont_2v3_neural_ci_lower: 0.6099\n591\t  result_rationale: 'Neural probe K*_neural 结果分裂：Pythia/OLMo=2 与 15D 一致，Qwen-cont=3\n592\t    高于 15D。 Qwen-cont 差异来自 self-scorer advantage。Median 档下 reviewer 解读： (a) Pythia/OLMo\n593\t    K*_neural=2 confirms \"K*=2 is data-intrinsic\"； (b) Qwen K*_neural=3 被部分 reviewer\n594\t    解读为 \"model-dependent K* exists\"， 与 \"K* is purely text-intrinsic\" narrative 矛盾；\n595\t    (c) 论文需 careful framing：model-free 15D features 给出 universal K*， neural probe\n596\t    给出 model-dependent K*，前者是推荐的 cross-model measure。\n597\t\n598\t    '\n599\t  tables:\n600\t  - name: 'Table A5: Neural probe vs 15D features'\n601\t    content: '| Model | K*(15D) | K*(neural) | 2v3 AUC (neural) |\n602\t\n603\t      |-------|---------|-----------|-----------------|\n604\t\n605\t      | Pythia-1.4B | 2 | 2 | 0.596 |\n606\t\n607\t      | OLMo-1B | 2 | 2 | 0.589 |\n608\t\n609\t      | Qwen-cont | 2 | 3 | 0.616 |\n610\t\n611\t      '\n612\t  figures_description:\n613\t  - 'Comparison bar chart: 15D vs neural probe pairwise AUC per model'\n614\t  analysis: 'Validates choice of model-free features for headline K*。 Qwen K*_neural=3\n615\t    被部分 reviewer 用来质疑 universality。\n616\t\n617\t    '\n618\t- name: exp-016\n619\t  plan_id: exp_016_base_vs_instruct\n620\t  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B base vs Instruct continuation mode comparison\n621\t  expected_results:\n622\t    k_star: 2\n623\t    base_1v2_auc: 0.6262\n624\t    base_ci_lower: 0.6168\n625\t    instruct_1v2_auc: 0.6112\n626\t    instruct_ci_lower: 0.6015\n627\t    ci_overlap: true\n628\t  result_rationale: 'Base 和 Instruct K* 一致=2，CI 重叠说明 instruction tuning 不改变 K*。 Base\n629\t    1v2 AUC (0.6262) > Instruct (0.6112)——instruction tuning 轻微降低 depth signal（RLHF\n630\t    增加生成多样性）。Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注。\n631\t\n632\t    '\n633\t  tables:\n634\t  - name: 'Table A6: Base vs Instruct'\n635\t    content: '| Variant | 1v2 AUC | 95% CI | K* |\n636\t\n637\t      |---------|---------|--------|-----|\n638\t\n639\t      | Base | 0.626 | [0.617, 0.635] | 2 |\n640\t\n641\t      | Instruct | 0.611 | [0.602, 0.621] | 2 |\n642\t\n643\t      '\n644\t  figures_description: []\n645\t  analysis: Supporting evidence。不是 highlight。\n646\t- name: exp-017\n647\t  plan_id: exp_017_qwen_continuation\n648\t  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n649\t  expected_results:\n650\t    k_star: 2\n651\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6112\n652\t    ci_1v2_lower: 0.6015\n653\t    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5609\n654\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112，CI lower=0.6015，仅高于 θ 0.15pp。 Median\n655\t    档核心攻击目标：reviewer 单独点名 \"CI lower=0.6015 is dangerously close to the threshold.\"\n656\t    exp-022 中 qwen_cont256×pythia K*=1 (1v2=0.5979) 进一步加剧 concern。论文需承认 Qwen-cont\n657\t    处于 K*=1/K*=2 边界， 作为 θ-sensitivity 讨论案例。但在 4-domain 框架下，Qwen-1.5B 在 Code 域 的 K*=2（1v2=0.7382，远超\n658\t    θ）抵消了 C4 边缘性的 concern——同模型在 不同域的 signal strength 差异大但 K* 一致（Code 和 C4 均 ceiling=2）。\n659\t\n660\t    '\n661\t  tables:\n662\t  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation'\n663\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n664\t\n665\t      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n666\t\n667\t      | Qwen-1.5B-Inst cont | 0.997 | 0.611 | 0.561 | 0.541 | 0.514 | 2 |\n668\t\n669\t      | 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.602, 0.621] | — | — | — | — |\n670\t\n671\t      '\n672\t  figures_description: []\n673\t  analysis: 'Median 档核心攻击目标。需正文承认 borderline nature 并提供多层辩护。 Cross-scorer 和 θ-sensitivity\n674\t    在正文中呈现。\n675\t\n676\t    '\n677\t- name: exp-018\n678\t  plan_id: exp_018_llama8b_depth\n679\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n680\t  expected_results:\n681\t    k_star: 2\n682\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6123\n683\t    ci_1v2_lower: 0.6028\n684\t    ci_1v2_upper: 0.6216\n685\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B K*=2，CI lower=0.6028 (余量 +0.28pp)。第三模型家族确认 C4 K*=2。\n686\t    0v1 AUC=0.9225 是所有模型中最低的——LLaMA continuation 与原文更相似（model quality 更高），整体 signal\n687\t    更弱但 K* 仍=2。LLaMA 在 Code 域也 K*=2（exp_code_llama8b, 1v2=0.7394），且 Code cross-scorer\n688\t    K*=2 confirmed（D079）， 是 Code ceiling=2 cross-family 的核心证据。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价\n689\t    LLaMA 的 multi-domain consistency（C4=2, Code=2, arXiv=3）， 但 C4 的低 0v1 AUC 暗示 \"larger\n690\t    models produce more human-like text\"， 与 scale limitation concern 呼应。\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  tables:\n694\t  - name: 'Table 2 (row): LLaMA-3.1-8B C4 continuation'\n695\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n696\t\n697\t      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n698\t\n699\t      | LLaMA-3.1-8B | 0.923 | 0.612 | 0.527 | 0.514 | 0.510 | 2 |\n700\t\n701\t      '\n702\t  figures_description: []\n703\t  analysis: 'LLaMA multi-domain profile (C4=2, Code=2, arXiv=3) 是 domain ceiling 框架的\n704\t    strongest evidence model——三个域均达到 ceiling。\n705\t\n706\t    '\n707\t- name: exp-019\n708\t  plan_id: exp_019_mistral7b_depth\n709\t  description: Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n710\t  expected_results:\n711\t    k_star: 1\n712\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.5935\n713\t    ci_1v2_lower: 0.5835\n714\t    ci_1v2_upper: 0.6032\n715\t    p_auc_leq_060: 0.9017\n716\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral C4 K*=1 是 C4 唯一 outlier（8/9 K*=2 中的例外）。Cross-scorer validation\n717\t    确认 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic。Median 档 reviewer 反应分裂： Reviewer A 接受 \"interpretable\n718\t    outlier\"，Reviewer B 攻击 \"model×domain interaction not pure domain dependence\"。Mistral\n719\t    arXiv K*=3 是回应——domain 仍是 primary factor。 在 4-domain 框架下，Mistral Code K*=1（median\n720\t    档预测）进一步增强 domain×competence interaction 论证：Mistral 在 C4 和 Code 两个 intermediate-\n721\t    complexity domains 均 K*=1，而在 extreme domain (arXiv) K*=3， 说明 Mistral 对 intermediate\n722\t    domains 的 generation competence 系统性不足。 论文需从 \"sole determinant\" 降级为 \"primary factor\"。\n723\t\n724\t    '\n725\t  tables:\n726\t  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Mistral-7B C4 continuation (K*=1)'\n727\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n728\t\n729\t      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n730\t\n731\t      | Mistral-7B | 0.984 | 0.594 | 0.540 | 0.523 | 0.518 | 1 |\n732\t\n733\t      | 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.584, 0.603] | — | — | — | — |\n734\t\n735\t      '\n736\t  figures_description:\n737\t  - Highlighted outlier in K* summary figure\n738\t  analysis: 'Median 档核心攻击点之一。4-domain 框架下 Mistral 的 pattern （C4=1, Code=1, arXiv=3,\n739\t    Wiki=1）最清晰地展示 domain×competence interaction。\n740\t\n741\t    '\n742\t- name: exp-020\n743\t  plan_id: exp_020_pythia_decoding\n744\t  description: 'Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: 4 strategies, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5'\n745\t  expected_results:\n746\t    all_k_star_2: true\n747\t    greedy_1v2: 0.8838\n748\t    nuc09_1v2: 0.677\n749\t    t07_1v2: 0.7265\n750\t    t12_1v2: 0.6172\n751\t  result_rationale: 'Pythia 4 种解码策略 K* 全=2，跨模型复制 exp-003 的解码不变性。 Greedy 1v2=0.8838\n752\t    因 repetition collapse 异常高。T=1.2 1v2=0.6172 最低 （高温增加随机性）。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价\n753\t    \"K*=2 holds across 2 models × 4 decoding strategies = 8 conditions\"，但 greedy 的异常高\n754\t    AUC 被注意——\"greedy is a degenerate condition\"。\n755\t\n756\t    '\n757\t  tables:\n758\t  - name: 'Table A7: Pythia decoding ablation'\n759\t    content: '| Decoding | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n760\t\n761\t      |----------|---------|---------|-----|\n762\t\n763\t      | greedy | 0.884 | 0.534 | 2 |\n764\t\n765\t      | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.677 | 0.555 | 2 |\n766\t\n767\t      | T=0.7 | 0.727 | 0.594 | 2 |\n768\t\n769\t      | T=1.2 | 0.617 | 0.523 | 2 |\n770\t\n771\t      '\n772\t  figures_description: []\n773\t  analysis: Supporting evidence, Appendix。Greedy repetition collapse 作为 caveat 提及。\n774\t- name: exp-021\n775\t  plan_id: exp_021_length_ablation\n776\t  description: 'Text length ablation: 128/256/512 tokens, Qwen continuation'\n777\t  expected_results:\n778\t    128tok_k_star: 2\n779\t    256tok_k_star: 2\n780\t    512tok_k_star: 2\n781\t    512tok_1v2_ci_lower: 0.5979\n782\t    512tok_verdict: BORDERLINE\n783\t  result_rationale: 'K*=2 在三种长度下一致。但 512tok CI lower=0.5979 < θ 是 borderline failure。\n784\t    Median 档 reviewer 注意到 \"longer texts paradoxically reduce discriminability\"。 解释：512\n785\t    tokens 的 continuation 更有空间 converge to generator''s style。 与 \"one-wash laundering\"\n786\t    概念一致。被 reviewer 归入 \"robustness limitations\" 段。\n787\t\n788\t    '\n789\t  tables:\n790\t  - name: 'Table A8: Length ablation'\n791\t    content: '| Length | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\n792\t\n793\t      |--------|---------|---------|-----|\n794\t\n795\t      | 128 tok | 0.622 | >0.60 | 2 |\n796\t\n797\t      | 256 tok | 0.628 | >0.60 | 2 |\n798\t\n799\t      | 512 tok | 0.607 | 0.598 | 2* |\n800\t\n801\t      '\n802\t  figures_description: []\n803\t  analysis: 512-token borderline 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 minor concern。\n804\t- name: exp-022\n805\t  plan_id: exp_022_cross_scorer_matrix\n806\t  description: '4×4 cross-scorer matrix: 4 generators × 4 scorers'\n807\t  expected_results:\n808\t    k_star_2_count: 11\n809\t    k_star_1_count: 1\n810\t    exception: qwen_cont256×pythia (1v2=0.5979)\n811\t    scorer_delta_within_generator: <0.025\n812\t  result_rationale: '11/12 combos K*=2 是 scorer independence 的强证据。唯一例外 qwen_cont256×pythia\n813\t    (K*=1) 因 Qwen-cont 本身 marginal 而 flip。 Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 scorer independence，但用\n814\t    qwen_cont×pythia 加强 Qwen-cont borderline 攻击。在 4-domain 框架下，Code 域 cross-scorer\n815\t    validation (Pythia scorer 重评 Qwen Code K*=2, Δ=-1.9pp) 和 arXiv 域 cross-scorer\n816\t    结果一起构成完整的 scorer independence 证据矩阵。 但 arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2 的下降（exp_arXiv_qwen7b_crossscorer:\n817\t    2v3 AUC=0.5989 < θ）被一位 reviewer 视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的 evidence——median 档核心假设之一。\n818\t\n819\t    '\n820\t  tables:\n821\t  - name: 'Table 10: Cross-scorer matrix (selected)'\n822\t    content: '| Generator × Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n823\t\n824\t      |-------------------|---------|-----|\n825\t\n826\t      | Qwen-base × OLMo | 0.605 | 2 |\n827\t\n828\t      | Qwen-base × Pythia | 0.617 | 2 |\n829\t\n830\t      | Qwen-cont × Pythia | 0.598 | 1 |\n831\t\n832\t      | Qwen-cont × Qwen-base | 0.628 | 2 |\n833\t\n834\t      '\n835\t  figures_description:\n836\t  - 4×4 heatmap of K* values in cross-scorer matrix\n837\t  analysis: 'Scorer independence confirmed overall。arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2\n838\t    是 median 档的新攻击面。cross_scorer_kstar_preservation_rate ~0.80 在 median 档范围 [0.75,\n839\t    0.85] 内。\n840\t\n841\t    '\n842\t- name: exp-023\n843\t  plan_id: exp_023_domain_ablation\n844\t  description: Wikipedia domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\n845\t  expected_results:\n846\t    k_star_same_scorer: 2\n847\t    k_star_cross_scorer: 1\n848\t    one_v_two_auc_same: 0.6193\n849\t    one_v_two_auc_cross: 0.587\n850\t    scorer_confound_delta: -0.024\n851\t  result_rationale: 'Wikipedia K*=2 (same-family scorer) 经 cross-scorer confound 控制后降为\n852\t    K*=1。 正文报告 scorer-controlled K*=1。6 个模型（包括 LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B, Pythia, OLMo,\n853\t    Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B）在 cross-scorer 控制后均 K*=1。 Qwen-7B same-scorer 的 K*=2 (1v2=0.6108)\n854\t    也被 confound 解释。 Median 档 reviewer 接受 confound 控制但质疑：\"If same-family scorer bias\n855\t    exists on Wikipedia, could it also affect C4 results?\" 在 4-domain 框架下，Wikipedia\n856\t    K*=1 是 \"extreme simplicity\" 端的锚点： 简单域信号一代即饱和，结构化域（arXiv）可延伸至 3 代。\n857\t\n858\t    '\n859\t  tables:\n860\t  - name: 'Table 11 (row): Wikipedia domain K*'\n861\t    content: '| Domain | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n862\t\n863\t      |--------|--------|---------|-----|\n864\t\n865\t      | Wikipedia | Qwen (same) | 0.619 | 2 |\n866\t\n867\t      | Wikipedia | Pythia (cross) | 0.587 | 1 |\n868\t\n869\t      | Wikipedia | scorer-controlled | — | 1 |\n870\t\n871\t      '\n872\t  figures_description:\n873\t  - 'Domain ladder figure: Wikipedia(1) < C4/Code(2) < arXiv(3)'\n874\t  analysis: 'Scorer confound 的 honest reporting 增加可信度。K*=1 for Wikipedia 被 reviewer\n875\t    解读为 \"trivial — one generation washes everything\"。\n876\t\n877\t    '\n878\t- name: exp-024\n879\t  plan_id: exp_024_arxiv_domain\n880\t  description: arXiv domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\n881\t  expected_results:\n882\t    k_star: 3\n883\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.858\n884\t    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.6427\n885\t    ci_2v3_lower: 0.6275\n886\t  result_rationale: 'arXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 最强证据——首个 K*>2 条件。 2v3 AUC=0.6427,\n887\t    CI lower=0.6275 >> θ。五模型跨四架构族 100% 一致 K*=3 （5/5 domain-competent models）。在 4-domain\n888\t    框架下，arXiv K*=3 是 \"extreme complexity\" 端的锚点。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 domain dependence\n889\t    但攻击 \"4 domains is still limited\"（虽然从 3 域升级到 4 域增强了覆盖）。 Reviewer 建议增加更多域（legal,\n890\t    news, social media）。 arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2 的下降（2v3 AUC 从 0.626 降至\n891\t    0.5989） 被一位 reviewer 视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的证据。\n892\t\n893\t    '\n894\t  tables:\n895\t  - name: 'Table 11 (row): arXiv domain K*'\n896\t    content: '| Domain | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | 3v4 AUC | K* |\n897\t\n898\t      |--------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\n899\t\n900\t      | arXiv (Qwen-1.5B) | 0.858 | 0.643 | 0.544 | 3 |\n901\t\n902\t      '\n903\t  figures_description:\n904\t  - 'AUC decay curves: 4 domains overlaid, showing domain-dependent saturation points'\n905\t  analysis: 'K*=3 on arXiv 是论文最强 individual finding。4-domain coverage 增强了 domain hierarchy\n906\t    证据链。arXiv cross-scorer concern 需 完整 bootstrap CI 呈现回应。\n907\t\n908\t    '\n909\t- name: exp-025\n910\t  plan_id: exp_025_pythia_filtering\n911\t  description: 'Pythia-1.4B filtering replication: 3 strategies × 3 seeds'\n912\t  expected_results:\n913\t    all_strategies_nearly_identical: true\n914\t    max_delta_mmlu: 0.0017\n915\t    binary_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0000'\n916\t    key_finding: null result\n917\t  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B 三种策略几乎相同（max Δ=0.0017 MMLU），filtering ordering 未确认。\n918\t    Pythia base capability 太低（MMLU=0.26 接近 random），filtering marginal benefit 在 low-capability\n919\t    regime 被淹没。一位 reviewer 认为这是 C3 negative results （结合 exp-026 arXiv null）削弱 practical\n920\t    relevance 的关键证据。 另一位 reviewer 肯定 \"honest reporting of negative results\"。 C3 证据链因此完全依赖\n921\t    exp-006 (Qwen) 和 exp-009 (dose-response)。\n922\t\n923\t    '\n924\t  tables:\n925\t  - name: 'Table A9: Pythia filtering (null result)'\n926\t    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\n927\t\n928\t      |----------|------|-----------|\n929\t\n930\t      | binary-ours | 0.259±0.000 | 0.525±0.000 |\n931\t\n932\t      | graduated α=0.9 | 0.256±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\n933\t\n934\t      | no-filter | 0.257±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\n935\t\n936\t      '\n937\t  figures_description: []\n938\t  analysis: 'Null result 放 Appendix。C3 substance ~2.5 因 Pythia+arXiv dual null。\n939\t\n940\t    '\n941\t- name: exp-026\n942\t  plan_id: exp_026_arxiv_filtering\n943\t  description: 'arXiv graduated vs binary filtering: Qwen base + LoRA, K*=3 domain,\n944\t    3 strategies × 5 seeds'\n945\t  expected_results:\n946\t    graduated_equals_no_filter: true\n947\t    binary_mmlu_delta: '-0.0023'\n948\t    binary_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0042'\n949\t    graduated_mmlu_delta: '+0.0001'\n950\t    key_finding: null result — graduated ≈ no_filter on K*=3 domain\n951\t  result_rationale: 'C3 的 fatal blow：即使在 K*=3 域 graduated ≈ no_filter。Binary 有 metric-specific\n952\t    trade-off（MMLU -0.23pp, HellaSwag +0.42pp）。 Median 档 reviewer：(a) \"graduated fails\n953\t    even where it should work best\" → K*-aware curation thesis undermined；(b) C3 降级为\n954\t    \"case study\"； (c) 关键 insight：K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility——\n955\t    depth 2-3 text 统计上可区分但移除不改善训练。\n956\t\n957\t    '\n958\t  tables:\n959\t  - name: 'Table 12: arXiv filtering results (negative)'\n960\t    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU | Δ HellaSwag |\n961\t\n962\t      |----------|------|-----------|--------|-------------|\n963\t\n964\t      | no-filter | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | — | — |\n965\t\n966\t      | binary | 0.588±0.000 | 0.664±0.000 | -0.002 | +0.004* |\n967\t\n968\t      | graduated α=0.9 | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | +0.000 | -0.000 |\n969\t\n970\t      '\n971\t  figures_description: []\n972\t  analysis: 'Negative result honestly reported。\"K* ≠ data utility\" insight 被一位 reviewer\n973\t    视为 \"interesting secondary finding\"。\n974\t\n975\t    '\n976\t- name: exp-027\n977\t  plan_id: exp_027_latex_ablation\n978\t  description: LaTeX markup removal ablation on arXiv data\n979\t  expected_results:\n980\t    k_star_preserved: true\n981\t    original_2v3: 0.6436\n982\t    stripped_2v3: 0.6229\n983\t    delta_2v3: -0.021\n984\t  result_rationale: 'K*=3 在去除 LaTeX 标记后保持，2v3 AUC 从 0.6436 降至 0.6229 但仍 > θ。 LaTeX\n985\t    格式贡献约 2pp AUC 但非 confound。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 \"rules out the obvious confound\"。Reviewer\n986\t    注意到 stripped 余量 +2.29pp， 如果进一步去除 citation/section numbering 可能降至 K*=2。\n987\t\n988\t    '\n989\t  tables:\n990\t  - name: 'Table A10: LaTeX ablation'\n991\t    content: '| Condition | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n992\t\n993\t      |-----------|---------|---------|-----|\n994\t\n995\t      | Original | 0.858 | 0.644 | 3 |\n996\t\n997\t      | LaTeX stripped | 0.830 | 0.623 | 3 |\n998\t\n999\t      | Δ | -0.028 | -0.021 | — |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4c4b2e3-74d5-42da-8308-39f7eee2e53c","uuid":"900cc3f5-4a3b-481b-911d-51cefc6805be","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:02:10.035Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260519T090934/median/review_context.yaml","content":"    或 learned detectors 作为 baseline。 在 4-domain 框架下，binary detector 在 Code 域同样 K*≈1，\n    进一步证明 depth estimation 需要超越 binary 的方法。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A4: Binary detector depth estimation'\n    content: '| Generator | 6-class Acc | ρ (ppl_ratio) | AUC monotonic? |\n\n      |-----------|------------|--------------|---------------|\n\n      | Qwen-rw | 0.199 | 0.119 | ❌ |\n\n      | Pythia | 0.130 | -0.392 | ❌ |\n\n      | OLMo | 0.127 | -0.407 | ❌ |\n\n      | Qwen-cont | 0.183 | -0.058 | ❌ |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: binary detector confidence vs true depth'\n  analysis: Strong justification。Median 档 reviewer 正面引用。\n- name: exp-013\n  plan_id: exp_013_cross_transfer\n  description: 4×4 cross-model transfer matrix\n  expected_results:\n    pythia_olmo_retention: 91-92%\n    qwen_cont_cross_retention: 80-85%\n    qwen_rw_cross_retention: 61-63%\n    binary_0v1_cross_all_above_096: true\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-model transfer 是 C1'' \"text-intrinsic signal\" 的核心证据。 Pythia↔OLMo\n    91-92% retention 和 0v1 cross-AUC > 0.96 强力支持 depth signal 跨模型可迁移。Median 档下 reviewer\n    正面评价但指出 \"all models are ≤8B from similar training distributions\"。 Code 域的 cross-scorer\n    validation（Pythia scorer 重评 Qwen Code generations K*=2 confirmed，Δ=-1.9pp）进一步扩展\n    transfer 证据到新域。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Cross-model transfer retention'\n    content: '| Transfer Direction | Accuracy Retention |\n\n      |-------------------|-------------------|\n\n      | Pythia → OLMo | 92% |\n\n      | OLMo → Pythia | 91% |\n\n      | Qwen-cont → Pythia | 85% |\n\n      | Qwen-cont → OLMo | 80% |\n\n      | Qwen-rw → Pythia | 63% |\n\n      | Qwen-rw → OLMo | 61% |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 4×4 transfer heatmap in main text\n  analysis: 'C1'' strongest supporting evidence 之一。Transfer > 80% 在 continuation mode\n    下 消除 scorer bias 质疑。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-014\n  plan_id: ''\n  description: 'Naturalistic validation: Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot depth prediction'\n  expected_results:\n    status: planned_not_executed\n    predicted_depth_distribution:\n      depth_0: 60-75%\n      depth_1: 15-25%\n      depth_2_plus: 5-15%\n    correlation_with_alignscore: Spearman ρ=0.15-0.30\n    correlation_with_vocab_richness: Spearman ρ=0.20-0.35\n  result_rationale: 'Naturalistic validation 未执行（P2 priority）。如果执行，预期 Common Crawl\n    中 约 25-40% 文本被预测为 depth ≥1，与外部估计一致。但 ground truth 缺失使此实验 无法做定量验证。Median 档 reviewer\n    不因缺失严重扣分，但 1 个 reviewer 建议 \"a naturalistic study would strengthen practical relevance\"，\n    特别是在 C3 negative results 削弱 practical motivation 之后。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 未执行。作为 future work 出现在 reviewer comments 中。\n- name: exp-015\n  plan_id: exp_015_neural_probe\n  description: Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B embeddings + MLP probe vs 15D features\n  expected_results:\n    pythia_k_star_neural: 2\n    olmo_k_star_neural: 2\n    qwen_cont_k_star_neural: 3\n    qwen_cont_2v3_neural_auc: 0.616\n    qwen_cont_2v3_neural_ci_lower: 0.6099\n  result_rationale: 'Neural probe K*_neural 结果分裂：Pythia/OLMo=2 与 15D 一致，Qwen-cont=3\n    高于 15D。 Qwen-cont 差异来自 self-scorer advantage。Median 档下 reviewer 解读： (a) Pythia/OLMo\n    K*_neural=2 confirms \"K*=2 is data-intrinsic\"； (b) Qwen K*_neural=3 被部分 reviewer\n    解读为 \"model-dependent K* exists\"， 与 \"K* is purely text-intrinsic\" narrative 矛盾；\n    (c) 论文需 careful framing：model-free 15D features 给出 universal K*， neural probe\n    给出 model-dependent K*，前者是推荐的 cross-model measure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A5: Neural probe vs 15D features'\n    content: '| Model | K*(15D) | K*(neural) | 2v3 AUC (neural) |\n\n      |-------|---------|-----------|-----------------|\n\n      | Pythia-1.4B | 2 | 2 | 0.596 |\n\n      | OLMo-1B | 2 | 2 | 0.589 |\n\n      | Qwen-cont | 2 | 3 | 0.616 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Comparison bar chart: 15D vs neural probe pairwise AUC per model'\n  analysis: 'Validates choice of model-free features for headline K*。 Qwen K*_neural=3\n    被部分 reviewer 用来质疑 universality。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-016\n  plan_id: exp_016_base_vs_instruct\n  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B base vs Instruct continuation mode comparison\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    base_1v2_auc: 0.6262\n    base_ci_lower: 0.6168\n    instruct_1v2_auc: 0.6112\n    instruct_ci_lower: 0.6015\n    ci_overlap: true\n  result_rationale: 'Base 和 Instruct K* 一致=2，CI 重叠说明 instruction tuning 不改变 K*。 Base\n    1v2 AUC (0.6262) > Instruct (0.6112)——instruction tuning 轻微降低 depth signal（RLHF\n    增加生成多样性）。Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A6: Base vs Instruct'\n    content: '| Variant | 1v2 AUC | 95% CI | K* |\n\n      |---------|---------|--------|-----|\n\n      | Base | 0.626 | [0.617, 0.635] | 2 |\n\n      | Instruct | 0.611 | [0.602, 0.621] | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Supporting evidence。不是 highlight。\n- name: exp-017\n  plan_id: exp_017_qwen_continuation\n  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6112\n    ci_1v2_lower: 0.6015\n    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5609\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112，CI lower=0.6015，仅高于 θ 0.15pp。 Median\n    档核心攻击目标：reviewer 单独点名 \"CI lower=0.6015 is dangerously close to the threshold.\"\n    exp-022 中 qwen_cont256×pythia K*=1 (1v2=0.5979) 进一步加剧 concern。论文需承认 Qwen-cont\n    处于 K*=1/K*=2 边界， 作为 θ-sensitivity 讨论案例。但在 4-domain 框架下，Qwen-1.5B 在 Code 域 的 K*=2（1v2=0.7382，远超\n    θ）抵消了 C4 边缘性的 concern——同模型在 不同域的 signal strength 差异大但 K* 一致（Code 和 C4 均 ceiling=2）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n\n      | Qwen-1.5B-Inst cont | 0.997 | 0.611 | 0.561 | 0.541 | 0.514 | 2 |\n\n      | 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.602, 0.621] | — | — | — | — |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Median 档核心攻击目标。需正文承认 borderline nature 并提供多层辩护。 Cross-scorer 和 θ-sensitivity\n    在正文中呈现。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-018\n  plan_id: exp_018_llama8b_depth\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6123\n    ci_1v2_lower: 0.6028\n    ci_1v2_upper: 0.6216\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B K*=2，CI lower=0.6028 (余量 +0.28pp)。第三模型家族确认 C4 K*=2。\n    0v1 AUC=0.9225 是所有模型中最低的——LLaMA continuation 与原文更相似（model quality 更高），整体 signal\n    更弱但 K* 仍=2。LLaMA 在 Code 域也 K*=2（exp_code_llama8b, 1v2=0.7394），且 Code cross-scorer\n    K*=2 confirmed（D079）， 是 Code ceiling=2 cross-family 的核心证据。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价\n    LLaMA 的 multi-domain consistency（C4=2, Code=2, arXiv=3）， 但 C4 的低 0v1 AUC 暗示 \"larger\n    models produce more human-like text\"， 与 scale limitation concern 呼应。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (row): LLaMA-3.1-8B C4 continuation'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n\n      | LLaMA-3.1-8B | 0.923 | 0.612 | 0.527 | 0.514 | 0.510 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'LLaMA multi-domain profile (C4=2, Code=2, arXiv=3) 是 domain ceiling 框架的\n    strongest evidence model——三个域均达到 ceiling。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-019\n  plan_id: exp_019_mistral7b_depth\n  description: Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 1\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.5935\n    ci_1v2_lower: 0.5835\n    ci_1v2_upper: 0.6032\n    p_auc_leq_060: 0.9017\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral C4 K*=1 是 C4 唯一 outlier（8/9 K*=2 中的例外）。Cross-scorer validation\n    确认 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic。Median 档 reviewer 反应分裂： Reviewer A 接受 \"interpretable\n    outlier\"，Reviewer B 攻击 \"model×domain interaction not pure domain dependence\"。Mistral\n    arXiv K*=3 是回应——domain 仍是 primary factor。 在 4-domain 框架下，Mistral Code K*=1（median\n    档预测）进一步增强 domain×competence interaction 论证：Mistral 在 C4 和 Code 两个 intermediate-\n    complexity domains 均 K*=1，而在 extreme domain (arXiv) K*=3， 说明 Mistral 对 intermediate\n    domains 的 generation competence 系统性不足。 论文需从 \"sole determinant\" 降级为 \"primary factor\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Mistral-7B C4 continuation (K*=1)'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n\n      | Mistral-7B | 0.984 | 0.594 | 0.540 | 0.523 | 0.518 | 1 |\n\n      | 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.584, 0.603] | — | — | — | — |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Highlighted outlier in K* summary figure\n  analysis: 'Median 档核心攻击点之一。4-domain 框架下 Mistral 的 pattern （C4=1, Code=1, arXiv=3,\n    Wiki=1）最清晰地展示 domain×competence interaction。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-020\n  plan_id: exp_020_pythia_decoding\n  description: 'Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: 4 strategies, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5'\n  expected_results:\n    all_k_star_2: true\n    greedy_1v2: 0.8838\n    nuc09_1v2: 0.677\n    t07_1v2: 0.7265\n    t12_1v2: 0.6172\n  result_rationale: 'Pythia 4 种解码策略 K* 全=2，跨模型复制 exp-003 的解码不变性。 Greedy 1v2=0.8838\n    因 repetition collapse 异常高。T=1.2 1v2=0.6172 最低 （高温增加随机性）。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价\n    \"K*=2 holds across 2 models × 4 decoding strategies = 8 conditions\"，但 greedy 的异常高\n    AUC 被注意——\"greedy is a degenerate condition\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A7: Pythia decoding ablation'\n    content: '| Decoding | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n\n      |----------|---------|---------|-----|\n\n      | greedy | 0.884 | 0.534 | 2 |\n\n      | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.677 | 0.555 | 2 |\n\n      | T=0.7 | 0.727 | 0.594 | 2 |\n\n      | T=1.2 | 0.617 | 0.523 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Supporting evidence, Appendix。Greedy repetition collapse 作为 caveat 提及。\n- name: exp-021\n  plan_id: exp_021_length_ablation\n  description: 'Text length ablation: 128/256/512 tokens, Qwen continuation'\n  expected_results:\n    128tok_k_star: 2\n    256tok_k_star: 2\n    512tok_k_star: 2\n    512tok_1v2_ci_lower: 0.5979\n    512tok_verdict: BORDERLINE\n  result_rationale: 'K*=2 在三种长度下一致。但 512tok CI lower=0.5979 < θ 是 borderline failure。\n    Median 档 reviewer 注意到 \"longer texts paradoxically reduce discriminability\"。 解释：512\n    tokens 的 continuation 更有空间 converge to generator''s style。 与 \"one-wash laundering\"\n    概念一致。被 reviewer 归入 \"robustness limitations\" 段。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A8: Length ablation'\n    content: '| Length | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\n\n      |--------|---------|---------|-----|\n\n      | 128 tok | 0.622 | >0.60 | 2 |\n\n      | 256 tok | 0.628 | >0.60 | 2 |\n\n      | 512 tok | 0.607 | 0.598 | 2* |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 512-token borderline 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 minor concern。\n- name: exp-022\n  plan_id: exp_022_cross_scorer_matrix\n  description: '4×4 cross-scorer matrix: 4 generators × 4 scorers'\n  expected_results:\n    k_star_2_count: 11\n    k_star_1_count: 1\n    exception: qwen_cont256×pythia (1v2=0.5979)\n    scorer_delta_within_generator: <0.025\n  result_rationale: '11/12 combos K*=2 是 scorer independence 的强证据。唯一例外 qwen_cont256×pythia\n    (K*=1) 因 Qwen-cont 本身 marginal 而 flip。 Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 scorer independence，但用\n    qwen_cont×pythia 加强 Qwen-cont borderline 攻击。在 4-domain 框架下，Code 域 cross-scorer\n    validation (Pythia scorer 重评 Qwen Code K*=2, Δ=-1.9pp) 和 arXiv 域 cross-scorer\n    结果一起构成完整的 scorer independence 证据矩阵。 但 arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2 的下降（exp_arXiv_qwen7b_crossscorer:\n    2v3 AUC=0.5989 < θ）被一位 reviewer 视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的 evidence——median 档核心假设之一。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Cross-scorer matrix (selected)'\n    content: '| Generator × Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n\n      |-------------------|---------|-----|\n\n      | Qwen-base × OLMo | 0.605 | 2 |\n\n      | Qwen-base × Pythia | 0.617 | 2 |\n\n      | Qwen-cont × Pythia | 0.598 | 1 |\n\n      | Qwen-cont × Qwen-base | 0.628 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 4×4 heatmap of K* values in cross-scorer matrix\n  analysis: 'Scorer independence confirmed overall。arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2\n    是 median 档的新攻击面。cross_scorer_kstar_preservation_rate ~0.80 在 median 档范围 [0.75,\n    0.85] 内。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-023\n  plan_id: exp_023_domain_ablation\n  description: Wikipedia domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star_same_scorer: 2\n    k_star_cross_scorer: 1\n    one_v_two_auc_same: 0.6193\n    one_v_two_auc_cross: 0.587\n    scorer_confound_delta: -0.024\n  result_rationale: 'Wikipedia K*=2 (same-family scorer) 经 cross-scorer confound 控制后降为\n    K*=1。 正文报告 scorer-controlled K*=1。6 个模型（包括 LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B, Pythia, OLMo,\n    Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B）在 cross-scorer 控制后均 K*=1。 Qwen-7B same-scorer 的 K*=2 (1v2=0.6108)\n    也被 confound 解释。 Median 档 reviewer 接受 confound 控制但质疑：\"If same-family scorer bias\n    exists on Wikipedia, could it also affect C4 results?\" 在 4-domain 框架下，Wikipedia\n    K*=1 是 \"extreme simplicity\" 端的锚点： 简单域信号一代即饱和，结构化域（arXiv）可延伸至 3 代。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11 (row): Wikipedia domain K*'\n    content: '| Domain | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n\n      |--------|--------|---------|-----|\n\n      | Wikipedia | Qwen (same) | 0.619 | 2 |\n\n      | Wikipedia | Pythia (cross) | 0.587 | 1 |\n\n      | Wikipedia | scorer-controlled | — | 1 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Domain ladder figure: Wikipedia(1) < C4/Code(2) < arXiv(3)'\n  analysis: 'Scorer confound 的 honest reporting 增加可信度。K*=1 for Wikipedia 被 reviewer\n    解读为 \"trivial — one generation washes everything\"。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-024\n  plan_id: exp_024_arxiv_domain\n  description: arXiv domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 3\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.858\n    pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.6427\n    ci_2v3_lower: 0.6275\n  result_rationale: 'arXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 最强证据——首个 K*>2 条件。 2v3 AUC=0.6427,\n    CI lower=0.6275 >> θ。五模型跨四架构族 100% 一致 K*=3 （5/5 domain-competent models）。在 4-domain\n    框架下，arXiv K*=3 是 \"extreme complexity\" 端的锚点。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 domain dependence\n    但攻击 \"4 domains is still limited\"（虽然从 3 域升级到 4 域增强了覆盖）。 Reviewer 建议增加更多域（legal,\n    news, social media）。 arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2 的下降（2v3 AUC 从 0.626 降至\n    0.5989） 被一位 reviewer 视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11 (row): arXiv domain K*'\n    content: '| Domain | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | 3v4 AUC | K* |\n\n      |--------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\n\n      | arXiv (Qwen-1.5B) | 0.858 | 0.643 | 0.544 | 3 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curves: 4 domains overlaid, showing domain-dependent saturation points'\n  analysis: 'K*=3 on arXiv 是论文最强 individual finding。4-domain coverage 增强了 domain hierarchy\n    证据链。arXiv cross-scorer concern 需 完整 bootstrap CI 呈现回应。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-025\n  plan_id: exp_025_pythia_filtering\n  description: 'Pythia-1.4B filtering replication: 3 strategies × 3 seeds'\n  expected_results:\n    all_strategies_nearly_identical: true\n    max_delta_mmlu: 0.0017\n    binary_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0000'\n    key_finding: null result\n  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B 三种策略几乎相同（max Δ=0.0017 MMLU），filtering ordering 未确认。\n    Pythia base capability 太低（MMLU=0.26 接近 random），filtering marginal benefit 在 low-capability\n    regime 被淹没。一位 reviewer 认为这是 C3 negative results （结合 exp-026 arXiv null）削弱 practical\n    relevance 的关键证据。 另一位 reviewer 肯定 \"honest reporting of negative results\"。 C3 证据链因此完全依赖\n    exp-006 (Qwen) 和 exp-009 (dose-response)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A9: Pythia filtering (null result)'\n    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\n\n      |----------|------|-----------|\n\n      | binary-ours | 0.259±0.000 | 0.525±0.000 |\n\n      | graduated α=0.9 | 0.256±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\n\n      | no-filter | 0.257±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Null result 放 Appendix。C3 substance ~2.5 因 Pythia+arXiv dual null。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-026\n  plan_id: exp_026_arxiv_filtering\n  description: 'arXiv graduated vs binary filtering: Qwen base + LoRA, K*=3 domain,\n    3 strategies × 5 seeds'\n  expected_results:\n    graduated_equals_no_filter: true\n    binary_mmlu_delta: '-0.0023'\n    binary_hellaswag_delta: '+0.0042'\n    graduated_mmlu_delta: '+0.0001'\n    key_finding: null result — graduated ≈ no_filter on K*=3 domain\n  result_rationale: 'C3 的 fatal blow：即使在 K*=3 域 graduated ≈ no_filter。Binary 有 metric-specific\n    trade-off（MMLU -0.23pp, HellaSwag +0.42pp）。 Median 档 reviewer：(a) \"graduated fails\n    even where it should work best\" → K*-aware curation thesis undermined；(b) C3 降级为\n    \"case study\"； (c) 关键 insight：K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility——\n    depth 2-3 text 统计上可区分但移除不改善训练。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: arXiv filtering results (negative)'\n    content: '| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU | Δ HellaSwag |\n\n      |----------|------|-----------|--------|-------------|\n\n      | no-filter | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | — | — |\n\n      | binary | 0.588±0.000 | 0.664±0.000 | -0.002 | +0.004* |\n\n      | graduated α=0.9 | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | +0.000 | -0.000 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Negative result honestly reported。\"K* ≠ data utility\" insight 被一位 reviewer\n    视为 \"interesting secondary finding\"。\n\n    '\n- name: exp-027\n  plan_id: exp_027_latex_ablation\n  description: LaTeX markup removal ablation on arXiv data\n  expected_results:\n    k_star_preserved: true\n    original_2v3: 0.6436\n    stripped_2v3: 0.6229\n    delta_2v3: -0.021\n  result_rationale: 'K*=3 在去除 LaTeX 标记后保持，2v3 AUC 从 0.6436 降至 0.6229 但仍 > θ。 LaTeX\n    格式贡献约 2pp AUC 但非 confound。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 \"rules out the obvious confound\"。Reviewer\n    注意到 stripped 余量 +2.29pp， 如果进一步去除 citation/section numbering 可能降至 K*=2。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A10: LaTeX ablation'\n    content: '| Condition | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n\n      |-----------|---------|---------|-----|\n\n      | Original | 0.858 | 0.644 | 3 |\n\n      | LaTeX stripped | 0.830 | 0.623 | 3 |\n\n      | Δ | -0.028 | -0.021 | — |","numLines":500,"startLine":500,"totalLines":1548}}}
