{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016cQUYXmhPcgYzusM5VUD8n","type":"tool_result","content":"999\t      | Δ | -0.028 | -0.021 | — |\n1000\t\n1001\t      '\n1002\t  figures_description: []\n1003\t  analysis: Effective confound control。Median 档 reviewer 不攻击。\n1004\t- name: exp-028\n1005\t  plan_id: exp_028_power_curve\n1006\t  description: 'Subsampling power curve: C4 n={500,1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10\n1007\t    resamples'\n1008\t  expected_results:\n1009\t    min_n_100pct: 2000\n1010\t    n500_rate: 0.2\n1011\t    n1000_rate: 0.3\n1012\t    n2000_rate: 1.0\n1013\t    n5000_rate: 1.0\n1014\t  result_rationale: 'n≥2000 给出 100% reliable K*=2 detection。n=1000 仅 30%。 回应 reviewer\n1015\t    sample size concern。Median 档 reviewer 评价 \"useful methodological contribution for\n1016\t    practitioners\"。 在 4-domain 框架下，arXiv 和 Code 域的 n=2200 和 n=5000 均满足 power requirements。\n1017\t\n1018\t    '\n1019\t  tables:\n1020\t  - name: 'Table A11: Subsampling power curve'\n1021\t    content: '| n | K*=2 detection rate | Mean 1v2 AUC |\n1022\t\n1023\t      |------|-------------------|-------------|\n1024\t\n1025\t      | 500 | 20% | 0.581 |\n1026\t\n1027\t      | 1000 | 30% | 0.591 |\n1028\t\n1029\t      | 2000 | 100% | 0.610 |\n1030\t\n1031\t      | 3000 | 100% | 0.617 |\n1032\t\n1033\t      | 5000 | 100% | 0.629 |\n1034\t\n1035\t      '\n1036\t  figures_description:\n1037\t  - 'Power curve: K*=2 detection rate as function of sample size'\n1038\t  analysis: Power analysis 回应统计 concern。如在 rebuttal 中补充可回应 reviewer。\n1039\t- name: exp_code_qwen1b5\n1040\t  plan_id: Code domain Qwen-1.5B\n1041\t  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B, Code/Python (CodeSearchNet), continuation, depth 0-5\n1042\t  expected_results:\n1043\t    k_star: 2\n1044\t    auc_0v1: 0.9388\n1045\t    auc_1v2: 0.7382\n1046\t    ci_1v2: '[0.709, 0.767]'\n1047\t    auc_2v3: 0.53\n1048\t    jsd_1v2: 0.0443\n1049\t    jsd_2v3: 0.0038\n1050\t    jsd_cliff_ratio_1v2_to_2v3: 11.7\n1051\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-1.5B Code K*=2 with 1v2 AUC=0.7382，远超 C4 同模型的 0.6262。 Code\n1052\t    域的 depth signal 更强（programming language 的 syntactic structure 提供额外 depth cues），但\n1053\t    K* ceiling 与 C4 相同=2。关键差异在 JSD cliff： Code 在 1v2→2v3 collapse（JSD ratio 11.7x），C4\n1054\t    在 0v1→1v2 有 large drop （JSD ratio ~9.8x）。这说明 domain structure 不仅决定 K* ceiling\n1055\t    还影响 signal decay pattern。Median 档 reviewer 接受 Qwen-1.5B Code K*=2 但指出仅一个模型不足以\n1056\t    claim \"Code ceiling=2\"。\n1057\t\n1058\t    '\n1059\t  tables:\n1060\t  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Qwen-1.5B Code domain'\n1061\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | JSD cliff |\n1062\t\n1063\t      |-------|------|------|------|----|-----------|\n1064\t\n1065\t      | Qwen-1.5B | 0.939 | 0.738 | 0.530 | 2 | 1v2→2v3 (11.7x) |\n1066\t\n1067\t      '\n1068\t  figures_description:\n1069\t  - 'JSD cliff comparison: Code vs C4, showing domain-specific signal decay patterns'\n1070\t  analysis: 'Code K*=2 with high 1v2 AUC 是 domain hierarchy 的重要扩展。 JSD cliff difference\n1071\t    (Code vs C4) 是 median 档论文的 nuanced finding。\n1072\t\n1073\t    '\n1074\t- name: exp_code_llama8b\n1075\t  plan_id: Code domain LLaMA-8B (D079)\n1076\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B, Code/Python, continuation, scorer=Qwen, depth 0-5\n1077\t  expected_results:\n1078\t    k_star: 2\n1079\t    auc_0v1: 0.9161\n1080\t    auc_1v2: 0.7394\n1081\t    ci_1v2: '[0.729, 0.750]'\n1082\t    auc_2v3: 0.5112\n1083\t    jsd_cliff_ratio: 13.5\n1084\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B Code K*=2 是 cross-family validation 的核心证据：Code ceiling=2\n1085\t    不是 Qwen 家族特有。1v2 AUC=0.7394 与 Qwen-1.5B 的 0.7382 高度一致， JSD cliff 13.5x。Scored\n1086\t    by Qwen（cross-family scorer），排除 scorer artifact。 Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 cross-family\n1087\t    confirmation。但注意到仅有两个模型 达到 ceiling（Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B），需要更多模型验证。 Pythia-1.4B\n1088\t    Code K*=1 和 Mistral-7B Code K*=1（median 预测）说明 Code ceiling=2 受 model code competence\n1089\t    调制。\n1090\t\n1091\t    '\n1092\t  tables:\n1093\t  - name: 'Table 14 (row): LLaMA-8B Code domain (cross-family)'\n1094\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | Scorer |\n1095\t\n1096\t      |-------|------|------|------|----|--------|\n1097\t\n1098\t      | LLaMA-8B | 0.916 | 0.739 | 0.511 | 2 | Qwen (cross-family) |\n1099\t\n1100\t      '\n1101\t  figures_description:\n1102\t  - Cross-family Code K* comparison bar chart\n1103\t  analysis: 'Cross-family Code ceiling=2 confirmation。与 Qwen-1.5B AUC 几乎相同 证明 Code\n1104\t    K*=2 是 text-intrinsic。\n1105\t\n1106\t    '\n1107\t- name: exp_code_pythia1b4\n1108\t  plan_id: Code domain Pythia-1.4B\n1109\t  description: Pythia-1.4B, Code/Python, continuation, depth 0-5\n1110\t  expected_results:\n1111\t    k_star: 1\n1112\t    auc_0v1: 0.9592\n1113\t    auc_1v2: 0.5983\n1114\t    ci_1v2_lower: 0.588\n1115\t    ci_1v2_upper: 0.609\n1116\t    auc_2v3: 0.5215\n1117\t  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B Code K*=1，1v2 AUC=0.5983 < θ=0.60（CI straddles θ）。\n1118\t    与 C4 上 Pythia K*=2 形成对比：Pythia 在 code generation 上 competence 不足 （The Pile 训练，code\n1119\t    占比低），生成的 code 质量差到单次生成即令 depth signal 饱和。这与 Mistral C4 K*=1 的 pattern 一致：model\n1120\t    domain-specific competence 不足时无法达到 domain ceiling。在 median 档 domain ceiling 框架下，\n1121\t    Pythia Code K*=1 是 \"ceiling=2 for models with sufficient code training\" caveat\n1122\t    的关键 data point。Reviewer 接受此解释但指出 \"the ceiling framework is becoming unfalsifiable\n1123\t    if every failure is attributed to insufficient competence。\"\n1124\t\n1125\t    '\n1126\t  tables:\n1127\t  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Pythia-1.4B Code domain (K*=1)'\n1128\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | Code competence |\n1129\t\n1130\t      |-------|------|------|------|----|----------------|\n1131\t\n1132\t      | Pythia-1.4B | 0.959 | 0.598 | 0.522 | 1 | Low (The Pile) |\n1133\t\n1134\t      '\n1135\t  figures_description: []\n1136\t  analysis: 'Code K*=1 consistent with domain×competence interaction。 但 \"insufficient\n1137\t    competence\" 解释的 unfalsifiability 被 reviewer 挑战。\n1138\t\n1139\t    '\n1140\t- name: exp_code_qwen1b5_pythia_scorer\n1141\t  plan_id: Code domain cross-scorer (D080)\n1142\t  description: Pythia-1.4B scorer re-evaluates Qwen Code generations\n1143\t  expected_results:\n1144\t    k_star: 2\n1145\t    auc_1v2: 0.7197\n1146\t    delta_vs_same_scorer: -0.0185\n1147\t  result_rationale: 'Pythia scorer 重评 Qwen Code generations K*=2 confirmed，Δ=-1.9pp。\n1148\t    与 Wiki 域的 scorer confound（same-family +1 bias）形成对比： Code 域 cross-scorer 下 K*=2\n1149\t    保持（Δ 小），说明 scorer confound 是 domain-specific 而非 systematic。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价：\n1150\t    \"Code cross-scorer validation is clean, contrasting with the Wikipedia confound。\"\n1151\t    但 arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2 的 drop 被 另一位 reviewer 引用——scorer confound\n1152\t    在某些 domain×model 组合中 仍存在，cross_scorer_kstar_preservation_rate ~80% 而非 100%。\n1153\t\n1154\t    '\n1155\t  tables:\n1156\t  - name: 'Table 14b: Code cross-scorer validation'\n1157\t    content: '| Generator | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* | Δ vs same-scorer |\n1158\t\n1159\t      |-----------|--------|---------|-----|-----------------|\n1160\t\n1161\t      | Qwen-1.5B Code | Qwen (same) | 0.738 | 2 | — |\n1162\t\n1163\t      | Qwen-1.5B Code | Pythia (cross) | 0.720 | 2 | -1.9pp |\n1164\t\n1165\t      '\n1166\t  figures_description: []\n1167\t  analysis: 'Code cross-scorer clean confirmation。与Wiki confound对比增强 \"scorer confound\n1168\t    is domain-specific\" narrative。\n1169\t\n1170\t    '\n1171\t- name: exp_code_mistral7b\n1172\t  plan_id: Code domain Mistral-7B (RUNNING)\n1173\t  description: Mistral-7B, Code/Python, continuation, depth 0-5 — RUNNING\n1174\t  expected_results:\n1175\t    k_star: 1\n1176\t    auc_0v1: 0.948\n1177\t    auc_1v2: 0.59\n1178\t    ci_1v2_lower: 0.575\n1179\t    ci_1v2_upper: 0.605\n1180\t    auc_2v3: 0.518\n1181\t    auc_3v4: 0.51\n1182\t    auc_4v5: 0.505\n1183\t    jsd_0v1: 0.068\n1184\t    jsd_1v2: 0.007\n1185\t    jsd_2v3: 0.004\n1186\t    ordinal_mae: 1.31\n1187\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.335\n1188\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B Code K*=1（1v2 AUC ~0.59，median 档范围 [0.56, 0.62] 中间值）。\n1189\t    与 Mistral C4 K*=1 一致，形成 coherent pattern：Mistral 在两个 intermediate- complexity\n1190\t    domains（C4 和 Code）均 K*=1，而在 arXiv K*=3。这不是因为 Mistral 是 \"bad model\"——arXiv K*=3\n1191\t    证明其有能力——而是因为 Mistral 对 homogeneous text domains 的 continuation 生成质量足够好，使得 one\n1192\t    generation 即令 depth signal 饱和。Code K*=1 进一步支持 domain×competence interaction： Mistral\n1193\t    的 code pretraining 可能不如 Qwen/LLaMA 充分（Mistral v0.3 的 code 训练数据占比未公开但推测较低），导致 code\n1194\t    generation 缺少 足够的 syntactic fidelity 来在 depth 1 和 depth 2 之间产生可检测差异。 Cross-scorer\n1195\t    validation（如果执行）预期确认 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic。 Median 档 reviewer 解读：code_models_at_ceiling2_of_5\n1196\t    = 3/5 （Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B, 可能 Qwen-7B），Mistral 和 Pythia 不达标。 这要求 \"ceiling=2\"\n1197\t    软化为 \"ceiling=2 for models with sufficient code training\"，被 reviewer 视为 ceiling\n1198\t    框架的 overfit concern。\n1199\t\n1200\t    '\n1201\t  tables:\n1202\t  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Mistral-7B Code domain (PREDICTED)'\n1203\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | Pattern |\n1204\t\n1205\t      |-------|------|------|------|----|---------|\n1206\t\n1207\t      | Mistral-7B | 0.948 | 0.590 | 0.518 | 1 | C4=1, Code=1, arXiv=3 |\n1208\t\n1209\t      '\n1210\t  figures_description:\n1211\t  - Mistral multi-domain profile showing domain×competence interaction\n1212\t  analysis: 'Mistral Code K*=1 与 C4 K*=1 模式一致，验证 domain ceiling 框架的 competence prerequisite。但\n1213\t    2/5 models failing ceiling 使 reviewer 质疑框架的 prescriptive power。\n1214\t\n1215\t    '\n1216\t- name: exp_code_qwen7b\n1217\t  plan_id: Code domain Qwen-7B (RUNNING)\n1218\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B, Code/Python, continuation, depth 0-5 — RUNNING\n1219\t  expected_results:\n1220\t    k_star: 2\n1221\t    auc_0v1: 0.935\n1222\t    auc_1v2: 0.63\n1223\t    ci_1v2_lower: 0.605\n1224\t    ci_1v2_upper: 0.655\n1225\t    auc_2v3: 0.525\n1226\t    auc_3v4: 0.512\n1227\t    auc_4v5: 0.508\n1228\t    jsd_0v1: 0.072\n1229\t    jsd_1v2: 0.02\n1230\t    jsd_2v3: 0.004\n1231\t    ordinal_mae: 1.22\n1232\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.348\n1233\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-7B Code K*=2 but marginal（1v2 AUC ~0.63，median 档范围 [0.60,\n1234\t    0.66] 中间值偏下）。CI lower ~0.605 仅高于 θ 约 0.5pp。与 Qwen-1.5B Code 的 1v2=0.7382 相比显著下降（Δ~-0.11），这是\n1235\t    counter-intuitive 的： 7B 模型在 Code 域的 depth signal 竟然弱于 1.5B。可能解释： (a) 7B 模型生成更高质量\n1236\t    code，使 depth 1→2 差异更小（model quality effect）； (b) scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 对 7B 生成文本的\n1237\t    score 能力受限（cross-scale scoring）； (c) 7B 的 code continuation 风格更稳定，代际间 variation\n1238\t    被压缩。 Median 档 reviewer 用 Qwen-7B Code 的 marginal result 挑战 \"Code ceiling=2\" 的\n1239\t    robustness：CI lower=0.605 下 θ=0.65 即 flip to K*=1。 但 K*=2 判定仍 pass θ=0.60，计入 code_models_at_ceiling2_of_5\n1240\t    = 3/5 （Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B, Qwen-7B）。一位 reviewer 质疑： \"If 1.5B gives cleaner K*=2\n1241\t    than 7B on code, your ceiling framework doesn''t predict signal strength, only\n1242\t    ceiling. Is that useful?\"\n1243\t\n1244\t    '\n1245\t  tables:\n1246\t  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Qwen-7B Code domain (PREDICTED)'\n1247\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | vs Qwen-1.5B |\n1248\t\n1249\t      |-------|------|------|------|----|-------------|\n1250\t\n1251\t      | Qwen-7B | 0.935 | 0.630 | 0.525 | 2 | 1v2 Δ=-0.108 |\n1252\t\n1253\t      '\n1254\t  figures_description:\n1255\t  - 'Code domain scale comparison: 1.5B vs 7B AUC decay'\n1256\t  analysis: 'Qwen-7B Code K*=2 marginal 是 median 档的关键不确定性。 3/5 models at ceiling 使\n1257\t    domain ceiling 框架需 caveat。 CI lower ~0.605 需在 θ-sensitivity 中特别讨论。\n1258\t\n1259\t    '\n1260\t- name: exp_arXiv_5model_crossvalidation\n1261\t  plan_id: exp_arXiv_llama8b / exp_arXiv_mistral7b / exp_arXiv_qwen7b / exp_025_pythia_arxiv\n1262\t  description: 'arXiv K*=3 cross-validation: 5 models × 4 architecture families'\n1263\t  expected_results:\n1264\t    qwen_1b5_k_star: 3\n1265\t    pythia_k_star: 3\n1266\t    llama_8b_k_star: 3\n1267\t    mistral_7b_k_star: 3\n1268\t    qwen_7b_k_star: 3\n1269\t    olmo_k_star: 1\n1270\t    domain_competent_k3_rate: 5/5 (100%)\n1271\t    qwen7b_2v3_auc: 0.626\n1272\t    mistral7b_2v3_auc: 0.6275\n1273\t  result_rationale: '五个 domain-competent 模型 100% 一致 K*=3。OLMo-1B K*=1 因 capacity failure。\n1274\t    Median 档 reviewer 高度正面评价但仍攻击 \"4 domains is still limited\"。 关键 concern：arXiv Qwen-7B\n1275\t    cross-scorer K*=3→2 的下降 （exp_arXiv_qwen7b_crossscorer: 2v3 AUC=0.5989 < θ）。 Median\n1276\t    档核心假设：这被一位 reviewer 视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的证据。 但其他模型的 cross-scorer K* 保持：LLaMA-8B\n1277\t    cross-scorer K*=3 (2v3=0.6201)，Mistral cross-scorer K*=3 (2v3=0.6075)， Qwen-1.5B\n1278\t    cross-scorer K*=3 (2v3=0.6317)。 整体 cross_scorer_kstar_preservation_rate = 3/4\n1279\t    = 0.75（Qwen-7B fail）， 在 median 档范围 [0.75, 0.85] 的下界。\n1280\t\n1281\t    '\n1282\t  tables:\n1283\t  - name: 'Table 13: arXiv K*=3 cross-validation + cross-scorer'\n1284\t    content: '| Model | Family | 2v3 AUC (same) | 2v3 AUC (cross) | K*(same) | K*(cross)\n1285\t      |\n1286\t\n1287\t      |-------|--------|---------------|----------------|---------|----------|\n1288\t\n1289\t      | Qwen-1.5B | Qwen | 0.643 | 0.632 | 3 | 3 |\n1290\t\n1291\t      | Pythia-1.4B | GPT-NeoX | 0.654 | — | 3 | — |\n1292\t\n1293\t      | LLaMA-8B | LLaMA | 0.622 | 0.620 | 3 | 3 |\n1294\t\n1295\t      | Mistral-7B | Mistral | 0.628 | 0.608 | 3 | 3 |\n1296\t\n1297\t      | Qwen-7B | Qwen | 0.626 | 0.599 | 3 | 2 ⚠️ |\n1298\t\n1299\t      '\n1300\t  figures_description:\n1301\t  - 'arXiv cross-scorer K* preservation: 3/4 models maintain K*=3'\n1302\t  analysis: 'Qwen-7B arXiv cross-scorer K*=3→2 是 median 档新攻击面。 论文需呈现完整 bootstrap CI\n1303\t    并讨论 scorer interaction on arXiv。 其他 3 个 cross-scorer 条件 K*=3 保持，整体证据链仍 positive。\n1304\t\n1305\t    '\n1306\t- name: exp_wiki_multimodel\n1307\t  plan_id: Wiki scorer-controlled analysis (D060)\n1308\t  description: 'Wikipedia K*=1 (scorer-controlled): 6 models all K*=1 after cross-scorer\n1309\t    control'\n1310\t  expected_results:\n1311\t    models_tested: 6\n1312\t    all_cross_scorer_k_star_1: true\n1313\t    qwen7b_same_scorer_k_star: 2\n1314\t    qwen7b_cross_scorer_k_star: 1\n1315\t    confound_pattern: same-family scorer +1 bias on Wiki only\n1316\t  result_rationale: '所有 6 个模型在 cross-family scorer 控制后均 K*=1 on Wikipedia。 Qwen-7B\n1317\t    same-scorer K*=2 (1v2=0.6108) 被 confound 解释。 Median 档 reviewer 接受 Wiki K*=1 为\n1318\t    domain hierarchy 的 floor。 4-domain 框架下，Wiki K*=1 是 \"extreme simplicity\" 锚点。 Reviewer\n1319\t    质疑：\"If we add social media (presumably even simpler than Wiki), would K* remain\n1320\t    1 or become 0 (i.e., even binary detection fails)?\"\n1321\t\n1322\t    '\n1323\t  tables:\n1324\t  - name: 'Table 11b: Wikipedia K*=1 (all models, scorer-controlled)'\n1325\t    content: '| Model | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n1326\t\n1327\t      |-------|--------|---------|-----|\n1328\t\n1329\t      | Qwen-1.5B | Pythia (cross) | 0.599 | 1 |\n1330\t\n1331\t      | Pythia-1.4B | Qwen (cross) | 0.585 | 1 |\n1332\t\n1333\t      | OLMo-1B | Qwen (cross) | 0.499 | 1 |\n1334\t\n1335\t      | LLaMA-8B | Qwen (cross) | 0.595 | 1 |\n1336\t\n1337\t      | Mistral-7B | Qwen (cross) | 0.555 | 1 |\n1338\t\n1339\t      | Qwen-7B | Pythia (cross) | 0.587 | 1 |\n1340\t\n1341\t      '\n1342\t  figures_description: []\n1343\t  analysis: 'Wiki K*=1 unanimous。Scorer confound 仅在 Wiki + same-family 触发， 不影响 C4/Code/arXiv\n1344\t    主线结论。\n1345\t\n1346\t    '\n1347\t- name: exp_retrain_depth7\n1348\t  plan_id: exp_qwen_retrain_depth7 / exp_pythia_retrain_depth7 (D077/D078)\n1349\t  description: 'Retrain-chain K*=7: two families (Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B), depth 0-7'\n1350\t  expected_results:\n1351\t    qwen_k_star: 7\n1352\t    pythia_k_star: 7\n1353\t    qwen_6v7_auc: 0.641\n1354\t    qwen_6v7_ci: '[0.638, 0.645]'\n1355\t    pythia_6v7_auc: 0.634\n1356\t    pythia_6v7_ci: '[0.628, 0.641]'\n1357\t    cross_family_k_star_match: true\n1358\t  result_rationale: '两个架构族在 retrain-chain 下一致 K*=7——尽管 LoRA effective capacity 差异约\n1359\t    3x（Qwen fused QKV vs Pythia independent QKV），K* ceiling 完全一致。 这进一步证明 K* 由 generation\n1360\t    process 决定而非 model capacity。 6v7 AUC 接近 θ=0.60（Qwen 0.641, Pythia 0.634）说明 depth\n1361\t    7 是 retrain-chain 的 operational boundary。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 two-family consistency\n1362\t    但指出 \"LoRA fine-tune 每代引入的 cumulative artifacts 是 setup-specific 的，不代表 full fine-tune\n1363\t    或 RLHF\"。 Prompt-chain K*=2 vs retrain-chain K*=7 的差距意味着 \"real-world contamination\n1364\t    detectability depends on the contamination mechanism\"——论文需讨论此 implication。\n1365\t\n1366\t    '\n1367\t  tables:\n1368\t  - name: 'Table 6b: Retrain-chain K*=7 (two families)'\n1369\t    content: '| Pair | Qwen-1.5B AUC | Pythia-1.4B AUC |\n1370\t\n1371\t      |------|--------------|----------------|\n1372\t\n1373\t      | 0v1 | 0.984 | 0.984 |\n1374\t\n1375\t      | 1v2 | 0.897 | 0.947 |\n1376\t\n1377\t      | 2v3 | 0.810 | 0.889 |\n1378\t\n1379\t      | 3v4 | 0.760 | 0.800 |\n1380\t\n1381\t      | 4v5 | 0.746 | 0.691 |\n1382\t\n1383\t      | 5v6 | 0.702 | 0.650 |\n1384\t\n1385\t      | 6v7 | 0.641 | 0.634 |\n1386\t\n1387\t      '\n1388\t  figures_description:\n1389\t  - Retrain-chain AUC decay to depth 7, two families, showing convergence at 6v7\n1390\t  analysis: 'Two-family K*=7 consistency 大幅增强 retrain-chain evidence。 与 prompt-chain\n1391\t    K*=2 的 gap 增强 \"text-intrinsic vs model-artifact\" 的 methodological insight。\n1392\t\n1393\t    '\n1394\t- name: exp_14b_c4\n1395\t  plan_id: Scale extension 14B\n1396\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B, continuation, C4, depth 0-5 — scale extension\n1397\t  expected_results:\n1398\t    k_star: 2\n1399\t    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.621\n1400\t    ci_1v2: '[0.612, 0.630]'\n1401\t  result_rationale: '14B K*=2 维持，CI lower=0.6119。Scale range 从 1.4B 扩展至 14B（10× range）。\n1402\t    Median 档 reviewer：(a) 接受 14B 扩展 \"extends scale range meaningfully\"； (b) 但要求 32B\n1403\t    确认 trend；(c) 14B 1v2 AUC=0.621 与 1.5B 的 0.626/0.611 无显著差异，支持 \"K* is scale-invariant\n1404\t    within 1-14B range\"。\n1405\t\n1406\t    '\n1407\t  tables:\n1408\t  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-14B C4'\n1409\t    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* |\n1410\t\n1411\t      |-------|------|------|------|----|\n1412\t\n1413\t      | Qwen2.5-14B | 0.960 | 0.621 | 0.549 | 2 |\n1414\t\n1415\t      '\n1416\t  figures_description:\n1417\t  - 'Scale invariance plot: 1.4B to 14B, K* flat at 2'\n1418\t  analysis: 'Rebuttal evidence for scale concern。如 32B 也确认， 可有效回应 \"≤8B limitation\"。\n1419\t\n1420\t    '\n1421\t- name: exp_32b_c4\n1422\t  plan_id: Scale extension 32B (RUNNING)\n1423\t  description: Qwen2.5-32B, continuation, C4, depth 0-5 — RUNNING\n1424\t  expected_results:\n1425\t    k_star: 2\n1426\t    auc_0v1: 0.945\n1427\t    auc_1v2: 0.615\n1428\t    ci_1v2_lower: 0.605\n1429\t    ci_1v2_upper: 0.625\n1430\t    auc_2v3: 0.545\n1431\t  result_rationale: '32B K*=2 预期维持但 signal 可能略弱（0v1 AUC ~0.945 继续 LLaMA-8B 的 下降趋势——更大模型生成更\n1432\t    human-like text）。1v2 AUC ~0.615， CI lower ~0.605 仍 > θ 但余量小。Scale range 扩展至 32B（23×\n1433\t    from 1.4B） 在 median 档下足以回应 scale concern：reviewer 从 \"significant weakness\" 降为\n1434\t    \"minor limitation (still no 70B+)\"。如果 32B 结果 < θ 则 trigger worst-case scenario，但\n1435\t    median 档假设 K*=2 维持。\n1436\t\n1437\t    '\n1438\t  tables:\n1439\t  - name: 'Rebuttal Table R1 (extension): Scale to 32B'\n1440\t    content: '| Scale | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\n1441\t\n1442\t      |-------|---------|---------|-----|\n1443\t\n1444\t      | 1.4B (Pythia) | 0.654 | 0.645 | 2 |\n1445\t\n1446\t      | 1.5B (Qwen) | 0.611 | 0.602 | 2 |\n1447\t\n1448\t      | 7B (Qwen) | 0.618 | 0.608 | 2 |\n1449\t\n1450\t      | 8B (LLaMA) | 0.612 | 0.603 | 2 |\n1451\t\n1452\t      | 14B (Qwen) | 0.621 | 0.612 | 2 |\n1453\t\n1454\t      | 32B (Qwen) | 0.615 | 0.605 | 2 |\n1455\t\n1456\t      '\n1457\t  figures_description:\n1458\t  - 'Extended scale plot: 1.4B to 32B, K* invariant at 2'\n1459\t  analysis: '32B confirmation 是 rebuttal 核心。23× scale range 下 K*=2 一致 大幅缓解 scale concern。\n1460\t\n1461\t    '\n1462\t- name: theta_sensitivity_full_sweep\n1463\t  plan_id: 'Supplementary: θ=0.55-0.70 full sweep figure'\n1464\t  description: θ-sensitivity full sweep across 4 domains × all models\n1465\t  expected_results:\n1466\t    wiki_stable_range: K*=1 for all θ in [0.55, 0.70]\n1467\t    c4_stable_range: K*=2 for θ ∈ [0.55, 0.63], K*=1 for θ ≥ 0.65 (most models)\n1468\t    code_stable_range: K*=2 for θ ∈ [0.55, 0.63] (competent models), K*=1 always (Pythia,\n1469\t      Mistral)\n1470\t    arxiv_stable_range: K*=3 for θ ∈ [0.55, 0.65], K*=2 for θ ≥ 0.67\n1471\t    domain_ceiling_clean_fit_pct: 88\n1472\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档要求 θ=0.55-0.70 全谱呈现。结果显示： (a) 极端域（Wiki, arXiv）θ-robust：Wiki\n1473\t    对任何 θ 都 K*=1， arXiv 在 θ≤0.65 时 K*=3 稳健（2v3 AUC 范围 0.61-0.65 across models）； (b)\n1474\t    中间域（C4, Code）θ-sensitive：θ 从 0.60 升至 0.65 时 C4 的 K*=2 models 中约一半 flip to K*=1；\n1475\t    (c) domain_ceiling_clean_fit_pct ~88%：定义为 \"在 θ=0.60 下， domain-competent models\n1476\t    的 K* 符合 domain ceiling 预测的比例\"。 5 models × 4 domains = 20 model-domain combinations（排除\n1477\t    OLMo arXiv capacity failure），domain ceiling 预测正确 ~17-18/20 = 85-90%。 不完美匹配来自 Mistral\n1478\t    C4 K*=1（ceiling=2）和 Pythia Code K*=1（ceiling=2）。 Median 档 reviewer 认为 88% fit\n1479\t    合理但 \"not clean enough to call it a framework — call it an empirical tendency\"。\n1480\t\n1481\t    '\n1482\t  tables:\n1483\t  - name: 'Figure 4 data: θ-sensitivity across 4 domains'\n1484\t    content: '| Domain | θ=0.55 | θ=0.60 | θ=0.65 | θ=0.70 |\n1485\t\n1486\t      |--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n1487\t\n1488\t      | Wiki | all K*=1 | all K*=1 | all K*=1 | all K*=1 |\n1489\t\n1490\t      | C4 | 8/9 K*=2 | 7/9 K*=2 | 4/9 K*=2 | 1-2/9 K*=2 |\n1491\t\n1492\t      | Code | 3/5 K*=2 | 3/5 K*=2 | 2/5 K*=2 | 1/5 K*=2 |\n1493\t\n1494\t      | arXiv | 5/5 K*=3 | 5/5 K*=3 | 4-5/5 K*=3 | 2-3/5 K*=3 |\n1495\t\n1496\t      '\n1497\t  figures_description:\n1498\t  - '主文 Figure 4: 4-domain θ-sensitivity heatmap, colored by K* value'"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4c4b2e3-74d5-42da-8308-39f7eee2e53c","uuid":"41d0b034-db93-4eb8-8a06-42beba32ec3d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:02:17.143Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260519T090934/median/review_context.yaml","content":"      | Δ | -0.028 | -0.021 | — |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Effective confound control。Median 档 reviewer 不攻击。\n- name: exp-028\n  plan_id: exp_028_power_curve\n  description: 'Subsampling power curve: C4 n={500,1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10\n    resamples'\n  expected_results:\n    min_n_100pct: 2000\n    n500_rate: 0.2\n    n1000_rate: 0.3\n    n2000_rate: 1.0\n    n5000_rate: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'n≥2000 给出 100% reliable K*=2 detection。n=1000 仅 30%。 回应 reviewer\n    sample size concern。Median 档 reviewer 评价 \"useful methodological contribution for\n    practitioners\"。 在 4-domain 框架下，arXiv 和 Code 域的 n=2200 和 n=5000 均满足 power requirements。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A11: Subsampling power curve'\n    content: '| n | K*=2 detection rate | Mean 1v2 AUC |\n\n      |------|-------------------|-------------|\n\n      | 500 | 20% | 0.581 |\n\n      | 1000 | 30% | 0.591 |\n\n      | 2000 | 100% | 0.610 |\n\n      | 3000 | 100% | 0.617 |\n\n      | 5000 | 100% | 0.629 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Power curve: K*=2 detection rate as function of sample size'\n  analysis: Power analysis 回应统计 concern。如在 rebuttal 中补充可回应 reviewer。\n- name: exp_code_qwen1b5\n  plan_id: Code domain Qwen-1.5B\n  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B, Code/Python (CodeSearchNet), continuation, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    auc_0v1: 0.9388\n    auc_1v2: 0.7382\n    ci_1v2: '[0.709, 0.767]'\n    auc_2v3: 0.53\n    jsd_1v2: 0.0443\n    jsd_2v3: 0.0038\n    jsd_cliff_ratio_1v2_to_2v3: 11.7\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-1.5B Code K*=2 with 1v2 AUC=0.7382，远超 C4 同模型的 0.6262。 Code\n    域的 depth signal 更强（programming language 的 syntactic structure 提供额外 depth cues），但\n    K* ceiling 与 C4 相同=2。关键差异在 JSD cliff： Code 在 1v2→2v3 collapse（JSD ratio 11.7x），C4\n    在 0v1→1v2 有 large drop （JSD ratio ~9.8x）。这说明 domain structure 不仅决定 K* ceiling\n    还影响 signal decay pattern。Median 档 reviewer 接受 Qwen-1.5B Code K*=2 但指出仅一个模型不足以\n    claim \"Code ceiling=2\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Qwen-1.5B Code domain'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | JSD cliff |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|----|-----------|\n\n      | Qwen-1.5B | 0.939 | 0.738 | 0.530 | 2 | 1v2→2v3 (11.7x) |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'JSD cliff comparison: Code vs C4, showing domain-specific signal decay patterns'\n  analysis: 'Code K*=2 with high 1v2 AUC 是 domain hierarchy 的重要扩展。 JSD cliff difference\n    (Code vs C4) 是 median 档论文的 nuanced finding。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_code_llama8b\n  plan_id: Code domain LLaMA-8B (D079)\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B, Code/Python, continuation, scorer=Qwen, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    auc_0v1: 0.9161\n    auc_1v2: 0.7394\n    ci_1v2: '[0.729, 0.750]'\n    auc_2v3: 0.5112\n    jsd_cliff_ratio: 13.5\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B Code K*=2 是 cross-family validation 的核心证据：Code ceiling=2\n    不是 Qwen 家族特有。1v2 AUC=0.7394 与 Qwen-1.5B 的 0.7382 高度一致， JSD cliff 13.5x。Scored\n    by Qwen（cross-family scorer），排除 scorer artifact。 Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 cross-family\n    confirmation。但注意到仅有两个模型 达到 ceiling（Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B），需要更多模型验证。 Pythia-1.4B\n    Code K*=1 和 Mistral-7B Code K*=1（median 预测）说明 Code ceiling=2 受 model code competence\n    调制。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14 (row): LLaMA-8B Code domain (cross-family)'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | Scorer |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|----|--------|\n\n      | LLaMA-8B | 0.916 | 0.739 | 0.511 | 2 | Qwen (cross-family) |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Cross-family Code K* comparison bar chart\n  analysis: 'Cross-family Code ceiling=2 confirmation。与 Qwen-1.5B AUC 几乎相同 证明 Code\n    K*=2 是 text-intrinsic。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_code_pythia1b4\n  plan_id: Code domain Pythia-1.4B\n  description: Pythia-1.4B, Code/Python, continuation, depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 1\n    auc_0v1: 0.9592\n    auc_1v2: 0.5983\n    ci_1v2_lower: 0.588\n    ci_1v2_upper: 0.609\n    auc_2v3: 0.5215\n  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B Code K*=1，1v2 AUC=0.5983 < θ=0.60（CI straddles θ）。\n    与 C4 上 Pythia K*=2 形成对比：Pythia 在 code generation 上 competence 不足 （The Pile 训练，code\n    占比低），生成的 code 质量差到单次生成即令 depth signal 饱和。这与 Mistral C4 K*=1 的 pattern 一致：model\n    domain-specific competence 不足时无法达到 domain ceiling。在 median 档 domain ceiling 框架下，\n    Pythia Code K*=1 是 \"ceiling=2 for models with sufficient code training\" caveat\n    的关键 data point。Reviewer 接受此解释但指出 \"the ceiling framework is becoming unfalsifiable\n    if every failure is attributed to insufficient competence。\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Pythia-1.4B Code domain (K*=1)'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | Code competence |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|----|----------------|\n\n      | Pythia-1.4B | 0.959 | 0.598 | 0.522 | 1 | Low (The Pile) |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Code K*=1 consistent with domain×competence interaction。 但 \"insufficient\n    competence\" 解释的 unfalsifiability 被 reviewer 挑战。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_code_qwen1b5_pythia_scorer\n  plan_id: Code domain cross-scorer (D080)\n  description: Pythia-1.4B scorer re-evaluates Qwen Code generations\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    auc_1v2: 0.7197\n    delta_vs_same_scorer: -0.0185\n  result_rationale: 'Pythia scorer 重评 Qwen Code generations K*=2 confirmed，Δ=-1.9pp。\n    与 Wiki 域的 scorer confound（same-family +1 bias）形成对比： Code 域 cross-scorer 下 K*=2\n    保持（Δ 小），说明 scorer confound 是 domain-specific 而非 systematic。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价：\n    \"Code cross-scorer validation is clean, contrasting with the Wikipedia confound。\"\n    但 arXiv Qwen-7B cross-scorer K*=3→2 的 drop 被 另一位 reviewer 引用——scorer confound\n    在某些 domain×model 组合中 仍存在，cross_scorer_kstar_preservation_rate ~80% 而非 100%。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14b: Code cross-scorer validation'\n    content: '| Generator | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* | Δ vs same-scorer |\n\n      |-----------|--------|---------|-----|-----------------|\n\n      | Qwen-1.5B Code | Qwen (same) | 0.738 | 2 | — |\n\n      | Qwen-1.5B Code | Pythia (cross) | 0.720 | 2 | -1.9pp |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Code cross-scorer clean confirmation。与Wiki confound对比增强 \"scorer confound\n    is domain-specific\" narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_code_mistral7b\n  plan_id: Code domain Mistral-7B (RUNNING)\n  description: Mistral-7B, Code/Python, continuation, depth 0-5 — RUNNING\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 1\n    auc_0v1: 0.948\n    auc_1v2: 0.59\n    ci_1v2_lower: 0.575\n    ci_1v2_upper: 0.605\n    auc_2v3: 0.518\n    auc_3v4: 0.51\n    auc_4v5: 0.505\n    jsd_0v1: 0.068\n    jsd_1v2: 0.007\n    jsd_2v3: 0.004\n    ordinal_mae: 1.31\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.335\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B Code K*=1（1v2 AUC ~0.59，median 档范围 [0.56, 0.62] 中间值）。\n    与 Mistral C4 K*=1 一致，形成 coherent pattern：Mistral 在两个 intermediate- complexity\n    domains（C4 和 Code）均 K*=1，而在 arXiv K*=3。这不是因为 Mistral 是 \"bad model\"——arXiv K*=3\n    证明其有能力——而是因为 Mistral 对 homogeneous text domains 的 continuation 生成质量足够好，使得 one\n    generation 即令 depth signal 饱和。Code K*=1 进一步支持 domain×competence interaction： Mistral\n    的 code pretraining 可能不如 Qwen/LLaMA 充分（Mistral v0.3 的 code 训练数据占比未公开但推测较低），导致 code\n    generation 缺少 足够的 syntactic fidelity 来在 depth 1 和 depth 2 之间产生可检测差异。 Cross-scorer\n    validation（如果执行）预期确认 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic。 Median 档 reviewer 解读：code_models_at_ceiling2_of_5\n    = 3/5 （Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B, 可能 Qwen-7B），Mistral 和 Pythia 不达标。 这要求 \"ceiling=2\"\n    软化为 \"ceiling=2 for models with sufficient code training\"，被 reviewer 视为 ceiling\n    框架的 overfit concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Mistral-7B Code domain (PREDICTED)'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | Pattern |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|----|---------|\n\n      | Mistral-7B | 0.948 | 0.590 | 0.518 | 1 | C4=1, Code=1, arXiv=3 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Mistral multi-domain profile showing domain×competence interaction\n  analysis: 'Mistral Code K*=1 与 C4 K*=1 模式一致，验证 domain ceiling 框架的 competence prerequisite。但\n    2/5 models failing ceiling 使 reviewer 质疑框架的 prescriptive power。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_code_qwen7b\n  plan_id: Code domain Qwen-7B (RUNNING)\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B, Code/Python, continuation, depth 0-5 — RUNNING\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    auc_0v1: 0.935\n    auc_1v2: 0.63\n    ci_1v2_lower: 0.605\n    ci_1v2_upper: 0.655\n    auc_2v3: 0.525\n    auc_3v4: 0.512\n    auc_4v5: 0.508\n    jsd_0v1: 0.072\n    jsd_1v2: 0.02\n    jsd_2v3: 0.004\n    ordinal_mae: 1.22\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.348\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-7B Code K*=2 but marginal（1v2 AUC ~0.63，median 档范围 [0.60,\n    0.66] 中间值偏下）。CI lower ~0.605 仅高于 θ 约 0.5pp。与 Qwen-1.5B Code 的 1v2=0.7382 相比显著下降（Δ~-0.11），这是\n    counter-intuitive 的： 7B 模型在 Code 域的 depth signal 竟然弱于 1.5B。可能解释： (a) 7B 模型生成更高质量\n    code，使 depth 1→2 差异更小（model quality effect）； (b) scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 对 7B 生成文本的\n    score 能力受限（cross-scale scoring）； (c) 7B 的 code continuation 风格更稳定，代际间 variation\n    被压缩。 Median 档 reviewer 用 Qwen-7B Code 的 marginal result 挑战 \"Code ceiling=2\" 的\n    robustness：CI lower=0.605 下 θ=0.65 即 flip to K*=1。 但 K*=2 判定仍 pass θ=0.60，计入 code_models_at_ceiling2_of_5\n    = 3/5 （Qwen-1.5B, LLaMA-8B, Qwen-7B）。一位 reviewer 质疑： \"If 1.5B gives cleaner K*=2\n    than 7B on code, your ceiling framework doesn''t predict signal strength, only\n    ceiling. Is that useful?\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14 (row): Qwen-7B Code domain (PREDICTED)'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* | vs Qwen-1.5B |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|----|-------------|\n\n      | Qwen-7B | 0.935 | 0.630 | 0.525 | 2 | 1v2 Δ=-0.108 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Code domain scale comparison: 1.5B vs 7B AUC decay'\n  analysis: 'Qwen-7B Code K*=2 marginal 是 median 档的关键不确定性。 3/5 models at ceiling 使\n    domain ceiling 框架需 caveat。 CI lower ~0.605 需在 θ-sensitivity 中特别讨论。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_arXiv_5model_crossvalidation\n  plan_id: exp_arXiv_llama8b / exp_arXiv_mistral7b / exp_arXiv_qwen7b / exp_025_pythia_arxiv\n  description: 'arXiv K*=3 cross-validation: 5 models × 4 architecture families'\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_1b5_k_star: 3\n    pythia_k_star: 3\n    llama_8b_k_star: 3\n    mistral_7b_k_star: 3\n    qwen_7b_k_star: 3\n    olmo_k_star: 1\n    domain_competent_k3_rate: 5/5 (100%)\n    qwen7b_2v3_auc: 0.626\n    mistral7b_2v3_auc: 0.6275\n  result_rationale: '五个 domain-competent 模型 100% 一致 K*=3。OLMo-1B K*=1 因 capacity failure。\n    Median 档 reviewer 高度正面评价但仍攻击 \"4 domains is still limited\"。 关键 concern：arXiv Qwen-7B\n    cross-scorer K*=3→2 的下降 （exp_arXiv_qwen7b_crossscorer: 2v3 AUC=0.5989 < θ）。 Median\n    档核心假设：这被一位 reviewer 视为 scorer confound 未完全控制的证据。 但其他模型的 cross-scorer K* 保持：LLaMA-8B\n    cross-scorer K*=3 (2v3=0.6201)，Mistral cross-scorer K*=3 (2v3=0.6075)， Qwen-1.5B\n    cross-scorer K*=3 (2v3=0.6317)。 整体 cross_scorer_kstar_preservation_rate = 3/4\n    = 0.75（Qwen-7B fail）， 在 median 档范围 [0.75, 0.85] 的下界。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: arXiv K*=3 cross-validation + cross-scorer'\n    content: '| Model | Family | 2v3 AUC (same) | 2v3 AUC (cross) | K*(same) | K*(cross)\n      |\n\n      |-------|--------|---------------|----------------|---------|----------|\n\n      | Qwen-1.5B | Qwen | 0.643 | 0.632 | 3 | 3 |\n\n      | Pythia-1.4B | GPT-NeoX | 0.654 | — | 3 | — |\n\n      | LLaMA-8B | LLaMA | 0.622 | 0.620 | 3 | 3 |\n\n      | Mistral-7B | Mistral | 0.628 | 0.608 | 3 | 3 |\n\n      | Qwen-7B | Qwen | 0.626 | 0.599 | 3 | 2 ⚠️ |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'arXiv cross-scorer K* preservation: 3/4 models maintain K*=3'\n  analysis: 'Qwen-7B arXiv cross-scorer K*=3→2 是 median 档新攻击面。 论文需呈现完整 bootstrap CI\n    并讨论 scorer interaction on arXiv。 其他 3 个 cross-scorer 条件 K*=3 保持，整体证据链仍 positive。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_wiki_multimodel\n  plan_id: Wiki scorer-controlled analysis (D060)\n  description: 'Wikipedia K*=1 (scorer-controlled): 6 models all K*=1 after cross-scorer\n    control'\n  expected_results:\n    models_tested: 6\n    all_cross_scorer_k_star_1: true\n    qwen7b_same_scorer_k_star: 2\n    qwen7b_cross_scorer_k_star: 1\n    confound_pattern: same-family scorer +1 bias on Wiki only\n  result_rationale: '所有 6 个模型在 cross-family scorer 控制后均 K*=1 on Wikipedia。 Qwen-7B\n    same-scorer K*=2 (1v2=0.6108) 被 confound 解释。 Median 档 reviewer 接受 Wiki K*=1 为\n    domain hierarchy 的 floor。 4-domain 框架下，Wiki K*=1 是 \"extreme simplicity\" 锚点。 Reviewer\n    质疑：\"If we add social media (presumably even simpler than Wiki), would K* remain\n    1 or become 0 (i.e., even binary detection fails)?\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11b: Wikipedia K*=1 (all models, scorer-controlled)'\n    content: '| Model | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n\n      |-------|--------|---------|-----|\n\n      | Qwen-1.5B | Pythia (cross) | 0.599 | 1 |\n\n      | Pythia-1.4B | Qwen (cross) | 0.585 | 1 |\n\n      | OLMo-1B | Qwen (cross) | 0.499 | 1 |\n\n      | LLaMA-8B | Qwen (cross) | 0.595 | 1 |\n\n      | Mistral-7B | Qwen (cross) | 0.555 | 1 |\n\n      | Qwen-7B | Pythia (cross) | 0.587 | 1 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Wiki K*=1 unanimous。Scorer confound 仅在 Wiki + same-family 触发， 不影响 C4/Code/arXiv\n    主线结论。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_retrain_depth7\n  plan_id: exp_qwen_retrain_depth7 / exp_pythia_retrain_depth7 (D077/D078)\n  description: 'Retrain-chain K*=7: two families (Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B), depth 0-7'\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_k_star: 7\n    pythia_k_star: 7\n    qwen_6v7_auc: 0.641\n    qwen_6v7_ci: '[0.638, 0.645]'\n    pythia_6v7_auc: 0.634\n    pythia_6v7_ci: '[0.628, 0.641]'\n    cross_family_k_star_match: true\n  result_rationale: '两个架构族在 retrain-chain 下一致 K*=7——尽管 LoRA effective capacity 差异约\n    3x（Qwen fused QKV vs Pythia independent QKV），K* ceiling 完全一致。 这进一步证明 K* 由 generation\n    process 决定而非 model capacity。 6v7 AUC 接近 θ=0.60（Qwen 0.641, Pythia 0.634）说明 depth\n    7 是 retrain-chain 的 operational boundary。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价 two-family consistency\n    但指出 \"LoRA fine-tune 每代引入的 cumulative artifacts 是 setup-specific 的，不代表 full fine-tune\n    或 RLHF\"。 Prompt-chain K*=2 vs retrain-chain K*=7 的差距意味着 \"real-world contamination\n    detectability depends on the contamination mechanism\"——论文需讨论此 implication。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6b: Retrain-chain K*=7 (two families)'\n    content: '| Pair | Qwen-1.5B AUC | Pythia-1.4B AUC |\n\n      |------|--------------|----------------|\n\n      | 0v1 | 0.984 | 0.984 |\n\n      | 1v2 | 0.897 | 0.947 |\n\n      | 2v3 | 0.810 | 0.889 |\n\n      | 3v4 | 0.760 | 0.800 |\n\n      | 4v5 | 0.746 | 0.691 |\n\n      | 5v6 | 0.702 | 0.650 |\n\n      | 6v7 | 0.641 | 0.634 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Retrain-chain AUC decay to depth 7, two families, showing convergence at 6v7\n  analysis: 'Two-family K*=7 consistency 大幅增强 retrain-chain evidence。 与 prompt-chain\n    K*=2 的 gap 增强 \"text-intrinsic vs model-artifact\" 的 methodological insight。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_14b_c4\n  plan_id: Scale extension 14B\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B, continuation, C4, depth 0-5 — scale extension\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.621\n    ci_1v2: '[0.612, 0.630]'\n  result_rationale: '14B K*=2 维持，CI lower=0.6119。Scale range 从 1.4B 扩展至 14B（10× range）。\n    Median 档 reviewer：(a) 接受 14B 扩展 \"extends scale range meaningfully\"； (b) 但要求 32B\n    确认 trend；(c) 14B 1v2 AUC=0.621 与 1.5B 的 0.626/0.611 无显著差异，支持 \"K* is scale-invariant\n    within 1-14B range\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-14B C4'\n    content: '| Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | K* |\n\n      |-------|------|------|------|----|\n\n      | Qwen2.5-14B | 0.960 | 0.621 | 0.549 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scale invariance plot: 1.4B to 14B, K* flat at 2'\n  analysis: 'Rebuttal evidence for scale concern。如 32B 也确认， 可有效回应 \"≤8B limitation\"。\n\n    '\n- name: exp_32b_c4\n  plan_id: Scale extension 32B (RUNNING)\n  description: Qwen2.5-32B, continuation, C4, depth 0-5 — RUNNING\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    auc_0v1: 0.945\n    auc_1v2: 0.615\n    ci_1v2_lower: 0.605\n    ci_1v2_upper: 0.625\n    auc_2v3: 0.545\n  result_rationale: '32B K*=2 预期维持但 signal 可能略弱（0v1 AUC ~0.945 继续 LLaMA-8B 的 下降趋势——更大模型生成更\n    human-like text）。1v2 AUC ~0.615， CI lower ~0.605 仍 > θ 但余量小。Scale range 扩展至 32B（23×\n    from 1.4B） 在 median 档下足以回应 scale concern：reviewer 从 \"significant weakness\" 降为\n    \"minor limitation (still no 70B+)\"。如果 32B 结果 < θ 则 trigger worst-case scenario，但\n    median 档假设 K*=2 维持。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Rebuttal Table R1 (extension): Scale to 32B'\n    content: '| Scale | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\n\n      |-------|---------|---------|-----|\n\n      | 1.4B (Pythia) | 0.654 | 0.645 | 2 |\n\n      | 1.5B (Qwen) | 0.611 | 0.602 | 2 |\n\n      | 7B (Qwen) | 0.618 | 0.608 | 2 |\n\n      | 8B (LLaMA) | 0.612 | 0.603 | 2 |\n\n      | 14B (Qwen) | 0.621 | 0.612 | 2 |\n\n      | 32B (Qwen) | 0.615 | 0.605 | 2 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Extended scale plot: 1.4B to 32B, K* invariant at 2'\n  analysis: '32B confirmation 是 rebuttal 核心。23× scale range 下 K*=2 一致 大幅缓解 scale concern。\n\n    '\n- name: theta_sensitivity_full_sweep\n  plan_id: 'Supplementary: θ=0.55-0.70 full sweep figure'\n  description: θ-sensitivity full sweep across 4 domains × all models\n  expected_results:\n    wiki_stable_range: K*=1 for all θ in [0.55, 0.70]\n    c4_stable_range: K*=2 for θ ∈ [0.55, 0.63], K*=1 for θ ≥ 0.65 (most models)\n    code_stable_range: K*=2 for θ ∈ [0.55, 0.63] (competent models), K*=1 always (Pythia,\n      Mistral)\n    arxiv_stable_range: K*=3 for θ ∈ [0.55, 0.65], K*=2 for θ ≥ 0.67\n    domain_ceiling_clean_fit_pct: 88\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档要求 θ=0.55-0.70 全谱呈现。结果显示： (a) 极端域（Wiki, arXiv）θ-robust：Wiki\n    对任何 θ 都 K*=1， arXiv 在 θ≤0.65 时 K*=3 稳健（2v3 AUC 范围 0.61-0.65 across models）； (b)\n    中间域（C4, Code）θ-sensitive：θ 从 0.60 升至 0.65 时 C4 的 K*=2 models 中约一半 flip to K*=1；\n    (c) domain_ceiling_clean_fit_pct ~88%：定义为 \"在 θ=0.60 下， domain-competent models\n    的 K* 符合 domain ceiling 预测的比例\"。 5 models × 4 domains = 20 model-domain combinations（排除\n    OLMo arXiv capacity failure），domain ceiling 预测正确 ~17-18/20 = 85-90%。 不完美匹配来自 Mistral\n    C4 K*=1（ceiling=2）和 Pythia Code K*=1（ceiling=2）。 Median 档 reviewer 认为 88% fit\n    合理但 \"not clean enough to call it a framework — call it an empirical tendency\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Figure 4 data: θ-sensitivity across 4 domains'\n    content: '| Domain | θ=0.55 | θ=0.60 | θ=0.65 | θ=0.70 |\n\n      |--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n\n      | Wiki | all K*=1 | all K*=1 | all K*=1 | all K*=1 |\n\n      | C4 | 8/9 K*=2 | 7/9 K*=2 | 4/9 K*=2 | 1-2/9 K*=2 |\n\n      | Code | 3/5 K*=2 | 3/5 K*=2 | 2/5 K*=2 | 1/5 K*=2 |\n\n      | arXiv | 5/5 K*=3 | 5/5 K*=3 | 4-5/5 K*=3 | 2-3/5 K*=3 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - '主文 Figure 4: 4-domain θ-sensitivity heatmap, colored by K* value'","numLines":500,"startLine":999,"totalLines":1548}}}
