{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G8RdSjzPTejvfoCSyEQT8e","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 gen-depth-contamination 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (82 个)\\n\\n- **exp_016_base_vs_instruct**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_003_decoding_ablation**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_004_7b_crossscale**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_E_paired_stats**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_D_obd_n500**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_B_14d_ablation**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_A_alt_scorer**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_015_neural_probe**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_006_graduated_filtering**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_007_bootstrap_ci**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_011_llm_zeroshot**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_013_cross_transfer**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_010_ordinal_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_pythia_depth**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_sat_v1**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-19\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_code_mistral7b | Mistral-7B code domain K* measurement: Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation on CodeSearchNet Python subset. Mistral 是唯一展现极端 domain dependence 的模型（C4 K*=1, arXiv K*=3）。若 code K*=2（与 Qwen/LLaMA 一致）→ code K* domain-governed, Mistral one-wash 仅限 C4。若 code K*=1 → one-wash 是 model-intrinsic property for non-academic text。5000 docs, depth 0-5, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B. | — | — | — |\\n| exp_32b_c4 | Scale-dependent K* on C4: Qwen2.5-32B fp16 continuation on C4 web text 的 K* 是否仍 = 2？验证 K*=2 dominant mode 在 32B scale 是否稳定（已确认 1.5B/7B/8B/14B 均 K*=2），排除 scale ceiling effect。5000 docs, depth 0-5, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B. | — | — | — |\\n| exp_code_qwen7b | Qwen2.5-7B code domain K* measurement: Qwen family scale invariance test on CodeSearchNet Python. Pythia Code K*=1 弱化了跨模型一致性。Qwen-7B 测试两个方向：(1) Qwen 家族内 Code 的 scale invariance（1.5B K*=2, 7B K*=?），(2) 若 LLaMA/Mistral 也 K*=1，Qwen-7B K*=2 能维持 \\\"code-competent models reach K*=2\\\" 叙事。5000 docs, depth 0-5, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_olmo_retrain_v2: OLMo-1B retrain-chain ecological validity (v2, fix M009 model download): LoRA rank=16, alpha=32, 1 epoch per generation on C4 5K docs. Retrain-chain K* ≤ prompt-chain K*=2, confirming prompt-chain as conservative upper bound. Independent LoRA per generation, depth 0-4, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B.（准备中）\\n- exp_008_retrain_chain: Retrain-chain ecological validity: Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32) retrain-chain K* ≤ prompt-chain K*=2. 每代独立 LoRA fine-tune 1 epoch on 前代输出，再用 fine-tuned model 生成下一代。验证 prompt-chain 是 conservative upper bound。C4 5K docs, depth 0-4, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B.（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_code_llama8b** (failed): Code domain (Python) cross-model K* validation: LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation on CodeSearchNet Python subset (Husain et al. 2019). 验证 code domain K* 跨模型一致性（与 exp_code_qwen1b5 对比）。如果 K* 一致，确认 code domain K* 是 domain-governed 而非 model-specific。5500 docs, depth 0-5, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B. ← 基于 exp_code_qwen1b5\\n- **exp_code_qwen1b5_pythia_scorer** (success): Code domain scorer confound control: Qwen-1.5B Code K*=2 uses same-family Qwen scorer. D060 Wikipedia showed Qwen scorer inflates AUC by +0.005~0.027. If Pythia-1.4B scorer yields K*=2 on same Qwen Code text, confirms K*=2 is text-intrinsic (not scorer artifact). If K*=1, Qwen Code K*=2 is partially scorer-driven, weakening domain ceiling claim. Cross-family scorer validation on existing exp_code_qwen1b5 depth 0-5 data. ← 基于 exp_code_qwen1b5\\n- **exp_pythia_retrain_depth7** (success): Pythia-1.4B retrain-chain depth extension to 7: 验证 retrain-chain K* >> prompt-chain K* 是否跨模型家族一致（Qwen retrain K*≥7）。如果 Pythia 也 K*≥5-7，confirms retrain artifacts are model-independent。C4 5K docs, LoRA rank=16 alpha=32, depth 0-7。 ← 基于 e\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0165CYwsThtTvPiiQ7Qc4fzw","session_id":"a4c4b2e3-74d5-42da-8308-39f7eee2e53c","uuid":"6e92f7e8-989a-416a-97d3-599b0e3d4202","timestamp":"2026-05-19T10:03:11.141Z"}
